    # mc "Tan solo me moría por besarte antes de ir a dormir."
    mc "I was just dying to kiss you before I went to sleep."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:259
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_ff54f211:

    # eil "No te tienes que esconder de mi madre para besarme. Soy una adulta y puedo besar a quien quiera. Y al único que quiero besar es a ti."
    eil "You don't have to hide from my mother to kiss me. Not from my mother or anyone else. I'm an adult and I can kiss whoever I want. And the only one I want to kiss is you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:260
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_1c7cd109:

    # mc "Entonces no me esconderé. Me voy a ir a mi sofá y os voy a dejar descansar... Un poco más y me olvido de coger la ropa."
    mc "Then I won't hide. I'm going to go to my couch and let you guys rest... I almost forgot to get my clothes."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:262
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_50dfb39e:

    # mc "Hasta mañana, mi amor."
    mc "See you tomorrow, my love."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:263
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_73d51b30:

    # eil "Hasta mañana, mi vida. Te quiero."
    eil "See you tomorrow, my life. I love you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:264
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_90083b80:

    # mc "Y yo a ti."
    mc "And I love you too."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:267
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_b47b16b6:

    # kia "¿Dónde has dicho que estaba el lavabo?"
    kia "Where did you say the toilet was?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:268
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_f445e6ec:

    # mc "La primera puerta a la izquierda una vez pases el gimnasio."
    mc "The first door on the left once you pass the gym."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:270
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_f364d0f9:

    # eil "Gracias por todo, [mc]. No sé qué hubiéramos hecho sin ti hoy."
    eil "Thank you for everything, [mc]. I don't know what we would have done without you today."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:271
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_e53ba6e2:

    # mc "Para eso estamos los amigos. Ya sabes que puedes contar conmigo para lo que necesites."
    mc "That's what friends are for. You know you can count on me for whatever you need."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:273
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_c4cd41ac:

    # eil "Cuánto te he echado de menos estos tres años. No hay hombres como tú."
    eil "How I've missed you these three years. There are no men like you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:274
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_8193145e:

    # mc "¿Como yo? Espera... ¿cómo me llamabas cuando salíamos juntos? ¿Cabeza hueca?"
    mc "Like me? Wait... what did you call me when we were dating? Airhead?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:276
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_8f3c4879:

    # eil "No, eso era lo que tú llamabas me llamabas a mí cuando empezamos a salir. *Risa*"
    eil "No, that was what you called me when we first started dating. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:277
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_cdd0ac73:

    # mc "Bueno, te voy a dejar descansar. Tienes que estar agotada después de trabajar y todo el problema que te has encontrado al llegar a casa."
    mc "Well, I'm going to let you rest. You must be exhausted after work and all the trouble you found yourself in when you got home."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:278
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_41ad32af:

    # mc "Hasta mañana, Eile."
    mc "See you tomorrow, Eile."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:279
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_3fd283cd:

    # eil "Hasta mañana, [mc]."
    eil "See you tomorrow, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:281
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_3523084d:

    # kia "¿Ya te marchas?"
    kia "Are you leaving already?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:282
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_2821dae0:

    # mc "Sí, es tarde y tenéis que descansar. Mañana tengo que ir a un par de sitios, pero si te despiertas pronto puedo llevarte al hospital."
    mc "Yes, it's late and you guys need to rest. I have a couple of places to go tomorrow, but if you wake up early, I can take you to the hospital."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:284
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_4630e054:

    # kia "[mc], ya te he dicho que no quería poner una denuncia..."
    kia "[mc], I already told you I didn't want to file a report..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:285
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_59f239a8:

    # mc "Te dejaré en manos de una enfermera que es buena amiga también. Si no quieres poner denuncia, no te va a obligar, pero al menos verá como está ese hematoma."
    mc "I will leave you in the hands of a nurse who is a good friend also. If you don't want to file a report, she's not going to force you, but at least she'll check that bruise."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:287
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_2066e28b:

    # "Kiara te abraza con fuerza. Es un abrazo que dice a gritos que está herida, más allá de las heridas físicas, que es vulnerable, y que necesita esa curación que dice que tus abrazos ofrecen."
    "Kiara hugs you tightly. It's a hug that cries out that she's hurt, beyond physical wounds, that she's vulnerable, and that she needs that healing she says your hugs offer."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:288
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_cd4373aa:

    # kia "Gracias, [mc]. Por darnos un techo y por entender mi decisión sobre la denuncia."
    kia "Thank you, [mc]. For giving us a roof over our heads and for understanding my decision on the report."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:289
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_c06cd2f2:

    # mc "No la comparto ni la comprendo, pero tengo que respetarla. No puedo obligarte a presentar una denuncia si no quieres."
    mc "I don't share it or understand it, but I have to respect it. I can't force you to file a report if you don't want to."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:290
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_d4dbd92c:

    # "Pasáis unos minutos en silencio, disfrutando del abrazo. Kiara se separa de ti reluctantemente."
    "You spend a few minutes in silence, enjoying the embrace. Kiara reluctantly pulls away from you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:292
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_fa9f4ae1:

    # kia "Buenas noches, [mc]. Que descanses bien."
    kia "Good night, [mc]. Have a good rest."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:293
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_556ca554:

    # mc "Buenas noches, Kiara. Duerme todo lo que puedas."
    mc "Good night, Kiara. Get as much sleep as you can."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:297
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_c4d9422a:

    # "Vuelves a la tercera planta después de cambiarte a algo más cómodo para dormir."
    "You return to the third floor after changing into something more comfortable to sleep in."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:298
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_e2a8a1db:

    # "Nunca pensaste que echarías de menos a Lisa en ese sofá."
    "You never thought you'd miss Lisa on that couch."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:300
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_4f7bd40e:

    # "Te tumbas mirando al techo. Sabes que te va a costar dormirte después de los eventos de la noc...zzzz"
    "You lie there staring at the ceiling. You know you're going to have a hard time falling asleep after the events of the ni... zzzz."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:302
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_83246def:

    # centered "{size=+20}{b}DIA 15 - MARTES \n 6:13{/b}{/size}"
    centered "{size=+20}{b}DAY 15 - TUESDAY 6:13{/b}{/size}"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:303
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_bc02ef79:

    # "Te despiertan unos pasos y la puerta del baño que se cierra."
    "You are awakened by footsteps and the bathroom door closing."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:305
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_22bfb38d:

    # "Miras el reloj del móvil. Las 6:13. Difícilmente vas a poder volver a dormirte. Ya ha amanecido."
    "You look at the phone clock. It's 6:13. You're hardly going back to sleep again. It's already dawn."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:307
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_a44d8959:

    # kat "Buenos días, [mc]. ¿Qué haces aquí? ¿Esperando a Lisa?"
    kat "Good morning, [mc]. What are you doing here? Waiting for Lisa?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:308
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_c20e358c:

    # mc "No, hay dos chicas en mi habitación y quería dejarlas dormir tranquilamente."
    mc "No, there are two girls in my room and I wanted to let them sleep peacefully."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:310
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_688fa6ff:

    # kat "¿Dos chicas en tu habitación? ¡Tenemos un macho en la casa!"
    kat "Two girls in your room? We've got a stud in the house!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:311
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_a34a775e:

    # mc "*Risa* No, no va por ahí. Son dos amigas que necesitaban un sitio donde pasar la noche. Les he prestado mi cama."
    mc "*Laugh* No, it isn't about that. They're two friends who needed a place to spend the night. I lent them my bed."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:313
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_620057e0:

    # kat "Entonces no es un macho, es un caballero. Podemos hacer un intercambio. Subo yo a tu habitación y tu duermes en mi cama. *Risa*"
    kat "So he's not a macho man, he's a gentleman. We can make an exchange. I come up to your room and you sleep in my bed. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:314
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_0ed05e30:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que os lo podríais pasar muy bien juntas, pero creo que no como tú esperarías."
    mc "*Laugh* I think you could have a great time together, but I think not the way you'd expect."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:315
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_07a63ac4:

    # mc "Una era mi novia en el instituto y la otra es su madre. Casada. Con un hombre."
    mc "One was my girlfriend in high school and the other one is her mother. Married. To a man."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:317
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_5ade8e4a:

    # kat "*Risa* Entonces no te cambio la cama. Además, Kim se podría asustar si se despierta y te ve a ti en vez de a mí."
    kat "*Laugh* Then I won't trade beds with you. Besides, Kim might freak out if she wakes up and sees you instead of me."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:319
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_0f251b26:

    # kat "Después de lo que le dijiste ayer del mapa de su piel... creo que la hiciste feliz por todo el día."
    kat "After what you told her yesterday about the map of her skin.... I think you made her happy for the whole day."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:320
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_bb4228c0:

    # mc "*Risa* Lo más divertido de todo es que no lo dije sobre ella en concreto, sino que lo dije en un hipotético caso. Además sonó muy cursi."
    mc "*Laugh* The funniest thing about it is that I didn't say it about her specifically, I said it in a hypothetical case. It also sounded really corny."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:322
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_3b9a9045:

    # kat "Después de lo que le dijiste ayer sobre su piel... creo que aún está enfadada contigo."
    kat "After what you said to her yesterday about her skin.... I think she's still mad at you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:323
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_0c54b117:

    # mc "Bueno, no era mi intención enfadarla, tan solo es que... creo que tenía razón si tanto le molesta llamar la atención."
    mc "Well, I didn't mean to upset her, I just.... I think I was right... if it bothers her so much to draw attention to herself."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:325
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_eaf840b2:

    # kat "¿Te importa que me siente?"
    kat "Do you mind if I sit down?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:326
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_c87da1de:

    # mc "Por supuesto que no. Soy yo quien ha invadido vuestra planta."
    mc "Of course not. It is I who invaded your floor."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:327
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_8cd07e23:

    # kat "Y nosotras hemos invadido tu casa. Lo podríamos llamar un empate."
    kat "And we've invaded your house. We could call it a draw."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:328
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_31ab9b11:

    # mc "¿Qué tal la adaptación a la nueva casa y a la nueva universidad?"
    mc "How's the adjustment to the new house and the new college?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:330
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_a9cde451:

    # kat "La universidad está genial. Tiene un muy buen programa de oceanografía y está cerca del mar. Estudiar en Phoenix sobre acuarios no tiene el mismo valor."
    kat "The university is great. It has a very good oceanography program and is close to the ocean. Studying in Phoenix about aquariums doesn't have the same value."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:331
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_5aa8514f:

    # mc "Está bien, es una universidad relativamente pequeña, pero de muy buen nivel."
    mc "It's fine, it's a relatively small university, but of a very good standing."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:332
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_f4b5c5b2:

    # mc "¿Y la casa? ¿Algún problema hasta ahora?"
    mc "What about the house? Any problems so far?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:334
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_138040f8:

    # kat "La casa es impresionante. Creía que siendo tan pocas podía haber problemas entre nosotras. Ya sabes... ser la primera gallina del corral y esas cosas."
    kat "The house is awesome. I thought with so few of us there might be problems between us. You know... being the first chicken in the pen and stuff."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:335
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_f34c0968:

    # kat "Además, ya conocía a Lisa y me imaginaba que iba a luchar por esa posición. Pero me está sorprendiendo mucho. Parece una mujer diferente de la de Phoenix."
    kat "Besides, I already knew Lisa and I figured she was going to fight for that position. But she's really surprising me. She seems like a different woman than in Phoenix."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:336
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_a3db4774:

    # mc "Parece incluso una mujer diferente de la que llegó el viernes al aeropuerto."
    mc "She even looks like a different woman than the one who arrived at the airport on Friday."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:338
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_4cc0eb54:

    # kat "No sé que le dais de comer, pero seguid haciéndolo. Me gusta más esta Lisa."
    kat "I don't know what you feed her, but keep doing it. I like this Lisa better."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:339
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_3bf2b707:

    # mc "A mí también. Hoy llega la última chica. Saira, de India."
    mc "Me too. The last girl arrives today. Saira, from India."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:341
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_62533d58:

    # kat "¡Oh! ¿Una belleza exótica?"
    kat "Oh! An exotic beauty?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:342
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_7e936e1f:

    # mc "Sí, lo es. Es una preciosidad. Nos conocemos de Portland."
    mc "Yes, she is. She's a cutie. We know each other from Portland."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:343
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_f08cc311:

    # kat "¿Otra ex-novia?"
    kat "Another ex-girlfriend?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:344
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_157800dc:

    # mc "Sí, ¿por qué lo preguntas?"
    mc "Yes, why do you ask?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:346
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_1bfae0f9:

    # kat "Tienes a tu ex-novia del instituto durmiendo en tu habitación y vas a tener a tu ex-novia de la universidad durmiendo justo debajo."
    kat "You've got your ex-girlfriend from high school sleeping in your room and you're going to have your ex-girlfriend from college sleeping right below her."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:347
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_d3afcc31:

    # kat "¿Tú has oido la expresión \"Pelea de Gatas\"?"
    kat "Have you ever heard the expression \"Catfight\"?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:348
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_57a8f307:

    # mc "Ni Eileen ni Saira son así."
    mc "Neither Eileen nor Saira are like that."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:350
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_58666c43:

    # kat "¿Eileen? ¿Pelirroja? ¿Guapísima? ¿Ojos azules? ¿Compañera de trabajo de [eri]?"
    kat "Eileen? Redhead? Gorgeous? Blue eyes? [eri]'s co-worker?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:351
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_3f08eb51:

    # mc "Sí, ¿por qué?"
    mc "Yes, why?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:353
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_39339162:

    # kat "¡Eres mi héroe! Si estando tan gordo como estabas en el instituto conseguiste que esa belleza se fijara en ti, hay esperanzas para el resto de nosotras."
    kat "You're my hero! If being as fat as you were in high school you got that beauty to notice you, there's hope for the rest of us!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:360
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_6bb56f62:

    # mc "Y no solo a cualquier chica. A cualquier persona. Eres divertida, inteligente, guapa..."
    mc "And not just any girl. Anyone. You're funny, you're smart, you're pretty..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:362
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_f8619787:

    # kat "[mc], ¿me estás tirando los trastos? *Risa* Por si no lo recuerdas, no me interesan los hombres... desde hace mucho."
    kat "[mc], are you hitting on me? *Laugh* In case you don't remember, I've had no interest in men... for a long time."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:363
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_0c9edb7a:

    # mc "{b}¿Qué? ¡No!{/b} * Risa* Eres de las pocas mujeres a quien le puedo decir que es guapa y que no se lo tomen como que quiero algo con ellas. No te estoy tirando los trastos, pero podría hacerlo."
    mc "{b}What? No!{/b} *Laugh* You're one of the few women I can tell she's pretty and won't take it as me wanting something with them. I'm not hitting on you, but I might as well."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:365
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_216fab8c:

    # kat "¿A qué te refieres exactamente?"
    kat "What exactly do you mean?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:366
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_d5332a23:

    # mc "Me caes muy bien. Ya te he dicho que eres divertida, inteligente, guapa... podría seguir con que tienes un gran sentido del humor, que no te dejas avasallar, que no tienes complejos..."
    mc "I really like you. I've already told you that you're funny, smart, beautiful.... I could go on about how you have a great sense of humor, don't let yourself be pushed around, don't have complexes..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:368
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_87ddd219:

    # mc "Tienes una personalidad arrolladora y, si te interesaran los hombres, es probable que te tirase los trastos. Creo que yo también te caigo bien."
    mc "You have an overwhelming personality and, if you were interested in men, I'd probably hit on you. I think you like me too."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:370
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_7b43f6fb:

    # mc "Tienes una personalidad arrolladora y, si te interesaran los hombres, es posible que te tirase los trastos. Aún no estoy seguro de que te caiga bien."
    mc "You have an overwhelming personality and, if you were interested in men, I might hit on you. I'm still not sure you like me."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:372
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_92bb93f5:

    # mc "Tienes una personalidad arrolladora y, si te interesaran los hombres, existe alguna posibilidad de que te tirase los trastos. Pero dudo que saliera bien. No creo que te caiga bien."
    mc "You have an overwhelming personality and, if you were interested in men, there's some chance I'd hit on you. But I doubt it would go well. I don't think you like me."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:375
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_ac349b40:

    # mc "Estuve en el lugar correcto en el momento correcto. Dudo que alguien como yo era entonces pudiera conseguir a alguien como Eileen en circunstancias normales."
    mc "I was in the right place at the right time. I doubt that someone like I was then could get someone like Eileen under normal circumstances."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:377
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_f66b080e:

    # kat "Eso quiere decir que, según tú yo no podría conseguir estar con alguien como Kim o a alguien como tú si me interesaran los hombres, ¿no? Suerte que no me interesan... desde hace mucho."
    kat "So that means, according to you, I couldn't get to be with someone like Kim or someone like you if I were interested in men, right? Lucky I've not been interested in men... for a long time."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:378
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_39c6d0f0:

    # mc "Dependería mucho de la otra persona."
    mc "It would depend a lot on the other person."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:380
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_216fab8c_1:

    # kat "¿A qué te refieres exactamente?"
    kat "What exactly do you mean?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:381
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_6beb8512:

    # mc "A mí me caes muy bien. Eres divertida, inteligente, guapa, tienes un gran sentido del humor, no te dejas avasallar, no tienes complejos..."
    mc "I really like you. You're funny, smart, beautiful, you have a great sense of humor, you don't get pushed around, you have no complexes..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:383
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_87ddd219_1:

    # mc "Tienes una personalidad arrolladora y, si te interesaran los hombres, es probable que te tirase los trastos. Creo que yo también te caigo bien."
    mc "You have an overwhelming personality and, if you were interested in men, I'd probably hit on you. I think you like me too."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:385
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_7b43f6fb_1:

    # mc "Tienes una personalidad arrolladora y, si te interesaran los hombres, es posible que te tirase los trastos. Aún no estoy seguro de que te caiga bien."
    mc "You have an overwhelming personality and, if you were interested in men, I might hit on you. I'm still not sure you like me."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:387
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_92bb93f5_1:

    # mc "Tienes una personalidad arrolladora y, si te interesaran los hombres, existe alguna posibilidad de que te tirase los trastos. Pero dudo que saliera bien. No creo que te caiga bien."
    mc "You have an overwhelming personality and, if you were interested in men, there's some chance I'd hit on you. But I doubt it would go well. I don't think you like me."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:388
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_88e95bfb:

    # mc "Pero lo tendrías más difícil con personas a las que le interesara más el físico perfecto que la personalidad."
    mc "But you'd have a harder time with people who cared more about perfect physique than personality."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:391
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_0f60830f:

    # kat "¡Wow! Eso me pasa por preguntar."
    kat "Wow! That's what I get for asking."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:392
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_62a18f55:

    # mc "Y ya que yo he respondido, ¿puedo hacer una pregunta?"
    mc "And since I've answered your question, may I ask one?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:394
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_73c1b90a:

    # kat "Sería justo que te dejara hacerla. No puedo asegurar que responda."
    kat "It would be fair to let you do it. I can't be sure I'll answer."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:395
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_501de8c1:

    # mc "¿Has dicho que no te interesan los hombres desde hace mucho?"
    mc "Did you say you haven't been interested in men for a long time?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:397
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_84745afb:

    # kat "*Risa* Uff, creía que sería una pregunta más complicada o comprometedora. Sí, lo he dicho."
    kat "*Laugh* Phew, I thought that would be a more complicated or compromising question. Yes, I said it."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:398
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_3133bb2f:

    # mc "No me refería a eso, la pregunta sería ¿qué pasó para que dejaran de interesarte?"
    mc "That's not what I meant, the question would be what happened to make you stop being interested?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:400
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_2d87f6a7:

    # kat "*Risa* Eso sería una segunda pregunta."
    kat "*Laugh* That would be a second question."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:401
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_8aa83788:

    # mc "Pero..."
    mc "But..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:402
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_f937556d:

    # kat "*Risa* No tengo la culpa de que no prestases atención a lo que decía y hayas gastado tu primera pregunta."
    kat "*Laugh* It's not my fault you weren't paying attention to what I was saying and you wasted your first question."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:403
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_f52554b8:

    # mc "*Risa* Vale, me estás tomando el pelo, ya lo pillo."
    mc "*Laugh* Okay, you're pulling my leg, I get it."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:405
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_4ec76d27:

    # kat "Por supuesto que te estoy tomando el pelo. Eres divertido y sabes encajarlo. *Risa*"
    kat "Of course I'm pulling your leg. You're funny and you know how to take a joke. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:406
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_e2aeb02c:

    # mc "Entonces... ¿contestas la pregunta?"
    mc "So... will you answer the question?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:408
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_35b64111:

    # kat "Es fácil. Solo he tenido una cita con un chico. Yo tenía 15 años y Isaac, el chico más popular de mi curso, me invitó a ir a cenar."
    kat "It's easy. I've only been on one date with one guy. I was 15 and Isaac, the most popular boy in my grade, asked me out to dinner."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:409
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_1d54b66e:

    # mc "Y algo salió mal."
    mc "And something went wrong."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:411
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_d17eafc6:

    # kat "Sí, que había una voz en off que no me dejaba explicarme. *Risa*"
    kat "Yeah, that there was a voiceover that wouldn't let me explain myself. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:412
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_a9f7b463:

    # mc "Vale, ya me callo. *Risa*"
    mc "Okay, I'll shut up now. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:414
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_46204cb0:

    # kat "Imagínate, la ballena del instituto saliendo con el chico más popular de mi clase. Era un sueño hecho realidad."
    kat "Imagine, the high school whale dating the most popular guy in my class. It was a dream come true."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:416
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_52fe00cd:

    # kat "Y como te puedes imaginar, yo me emperifollé toda, pedí a mis padres que me compraran un vestido nuevo, llegué al lugar de la cita y allí estaba él, guapísimo."
    kat "And as you can imagine, I got all dolled up, asked my parents to buy me a new dress, arrived at the date spot and there he was, looking absolutely handsome."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:418
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_324cce21:

    # kat "Rodeado de todos sus amigos y amigas... riéndose de mí. Algo sacado de una película mala de instituto donde todos los populares son gilipollas y se ríen de la perdedora."
    kat "Surrounded by all his friends and girlfriends... laughing at me. Something out of a bad high school movie where all the popular people are assholes and laughing at the loser."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:419
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_5672dac6:

    # mc "Lo siento, Kate."
    mc "I'm sorry, Kate."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:421
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_5297c865:

    # kat "Besó a una de las animadoras, tan solo para demostrar que podía besar a quien quisiera y que no lo iba a hacer conmigo."
    kat "He kissed one of the cheerleaders, just to prove that he could kiss whoever he wanted to and he wasn't going to do it with me."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:422
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_bc67a668:

    # mc "Ese crío era un capullo. Los hay en todos los institutos."
    mc "That kid was a dick. They're in every school."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:424
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_36762656:

    # kat "Pero como en todas las películas malas, la perdedora acabó ganando. Dos meses después estaba saliendo con esa misma animadora. Jennifer. Fue mi primera novia."
    kat "But as in all bad movies, the loser ended up winning. Two months later I was dating that same cheerleader. Jennifer. She was my first girlfriend."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:425
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_6605351c:

    # kat "Ella me enseñó que no necesitaba a un chico para ser feliz, para sentirme querida y especial."
    kat "She taught me that I didn't need a boy to be happy, to feel loved and special."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:426
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_46a729b1:

    # mc "¿Cómo se lo tomó aquel chico?"
    mc "How did that boy take it?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:428
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_318df991:

    # kat "No le dió importancia hasta que Jennifer colgó una foto en InstaPic de nosotras dos besándonos."
    kat "He didn't give it a second thought until Jennifer posted a picture on InstaPic of the two of us kissing."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:429
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_1158143d:

    # kat "El texto decía \"Me ha costado dos meses quitarme el mal sabor de boca de un beso horrible de Isaac. Besa tan mal que me ha vuelto lesbiana.\" Como te puedes imaginar, ella siempre lo había sido."
    kat "The text read \"It's taken me two months to get the bad taste out of my mouth from a horrible kiss from Isaac. He's such a bad kisser that he has turned me into a lesbian\". As you can imagine, she had always been one."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:430
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_7aad78cf:

    # mc "¡Bien por Jennifer!"
    mc "Good for Jennifer!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:432
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_4800ba71:

    # kat "Y esa es la historia de por qué solo salgo con chicas. Sigo apreciando el aspecto de un chico guapo, pero no voy a dejar que me hagan daño otra vez."
    kat "And that's the story of why I only date girls. I still appreciate the looks of a cute guy, but I'm not going to let them hurt me again."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:433
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_e3841a2a:

    # kat "Pero que un chico como tú se planteara tirarme los trastos... me sorprende."
    kat "But that a guy like you would even consider hitting on me... I'm stunned."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:434
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_f28d45d9:

    # mc "¿Un chico como yo? Kate, ¿me estás tirando los trastos? *Risa*"
    mc "A guy like me? Kate, are you hitting on me? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:436
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_a31dfe94:

    # kat "*Risa* No solo es guapo y sabe encajar las bromas, también sabe devolverlas."
    kat "*Laugh* He's not only cute and knows how to take a joke, he knows how to return it."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:437
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_e5f90eb8:

    # mc "¿Dónde estaría lo divertido si sólo recibiera uno?"
    mc "Where would the fun be if only one of us was at the receiving end?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:438
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_4ae2fa75:

    # "Justo en ese momento escuchas pasos en la escalera."
    "Just then you hear footsteps on the stairs."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:440
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_ad0c015f:

    # mom "¿Qué hacéis aquí tan temprano? ¿Le has pillado el gusto a dormir en el sofá, [mc]? *Risa* ¿Hoy has cambiado a Lisa por Kate?"
    mom "What are you guys doing here so early? Have you gotten into the habit of sleeping on the couch, [mc]? *Laugh* Did you trade Lisa for Kate today?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:441
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_57eee0fd:

    # mc "¿Cómo sabes tú eso?"
    mc "How do you know about that?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:443
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_22add2b2:

    # kat "Ayer Lisa lo comentó varias veces. Por lo visto hablar contigo le ayudó mucho... en algo."
    kat "Lisa commented on it several times yesterday. Apparently talking to you helped her a lot... at something."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:444
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_790fd913:

    # mc "Ah, vale."
    mc "Ah, okay."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:446
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_e6a7f6fd:

    # kat "Pero no te preocupes, [mar]. Esta vez lo he encontrado yo durmiendo en el sofá."
    kat "But don't worry, [mar]. This time I found him sleeping on the couch alone."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:448
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_c770cb25:

    # mom "¿Ha pasado algo en tu habitación?"
    mom "Did something happen in your room?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:449
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_710fb6f5:

    # mc "Algo. Tenemos que hablar."
    mc "Something. We need to talk."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:451
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_09809368:

    # kat "Yo voy a darme una ducha. Os dejo hablar tranquilos."
    kat "I'm going to take a shower. I'll let you guys talk to each other."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:452
translate english c13s001_SleepingInTheCouch_f090d085:

    # mc "Nosotros vamos a bajar a la sala de abajo, es el sitio más alejado de cualquier habitación."
    mc "We're going to the downstairs living room, it's the farthest place from any room."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:456
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_5d815bcc:

    # mom "¿Qué ha pasado?"
    mom "What happened?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:458
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_7e70543d:

    # mc "Ahora te lo explico, pero antes quiero un beso."
    mc "I'll explain it to you in a moment, but first I'd like a kiss."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:460
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_ef8d8600:

    # mom "Mmmmm... subía a ver si estabas despierto para besarte antes de que todo el mundo se despertara. Verte con Kate ha hecho que me despiste."
    mom "Mmmmm... I was coming upstairs to see if you were awake so I could kiss you before everyone else woke up. Seeing you with Kate threw me off."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:461
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_e45119d0:

    # mc "Problema resuelto. *Risa* Sobre lo que ha pasado..."
    mc "Problem solved. *Laugh* About what happened..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:462
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_f3c32356:

    # mc "Eileen y su madre están durmiendo en mi habitación"
    mc "Eileen and her mother are sleeping in my room."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:464
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_efa5675d:

    # mom "{b}¿Qué?{/b} ¿Por qué?"
    mom "{b}What?{/b} Why?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:466
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_587cf335:

    # mom "Tu y ellas..."
    mom "You and them..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:467
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_45958c14:

    # mc "No, no es eso, no te preocupes."
    mc "No, it's not that, don't worry."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:468
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_8b27aefd:

    # mc "Solomon se puso violento ayer con Kiara."
    mc "Solomon got violent with Kiara yesterday."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:470
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_fa919086:

    # mom "{b}¿Qué?{/b} ¿Kiara está bien?"
    mom "{b}What?{/b} Is Kiara okay?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:471
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_f36f5c8c:

    # mc "Tiene un hematoma gigante en el antebrazo. Por el resto parece estar bien... físicamente."
    mc "She has a giant bruise on her forearm. Otherwise she seems fine... physically."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:472
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_ee742ba8:

    # mc "Cuando se despierte quiero llevarla al hospital a que vea a Samantha."
    mc "When she wakes up, I want to take her to the hospital to see Samantha."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:474
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_d4314175:

    # mom "Sí, es lo mejor. Así tendrá un informe para presentar a la policía."
    mom "Yes, that's the best. Then she'll have a medical report to present to the police."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:475
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_71334393:

    # mc "No quiere presentar denuncia. Ni siquiera quiere ir al hospital."
    mc "She doesn't want to file a report. She doesn't even want to go to the hospital."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:476
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_66e101df:

    # mc "Quería volver a casa mañana... la he convencido para que pase unos días en casa. Todavía hay una habitación libre en casa de [nor]. No sé si me he tomado muchas libertades..."
    mc "She wanted to return home tomorrow... I've convinced her to spend a few days here. There's still a spare room at [nor]'s house. I don't know if I've taken too many liberties..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:478
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_6e36c916:

    # mom "No, para nada. Si alguien tiene problemas, debemos que ayudarlo. Tenemos una habitación libre hasta que lleguen las otras estudiantes, no creo que haya mejor forma de usarla."
    mom "No, not at all. If someone is in trouble, we have to help them. We have a spare room until the other students arrive, I don't think there's a better way to use it."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:479
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_34e25155:

    # mc "De todas formas creo que debería haberlo consultado con [nor], pero era pasada la medianoche cuando hemos llegado a casa."
    mc "Anyway I think I should have checked with [nor], but it was after midnight when we got home."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:481
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_a871a070:

    # mom "Llámala y dile que venga. Ya debe estar despierta. Yo no he bajado el móvil."
    mom "Call her and tell her to come over. She should be awake by now. I haven't brought my phone with me."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:482
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_62d7ae47:

    # mc "OK, dáme un segundo."
    mc "OK, give me a second."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:484
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_33abc69f:

    # "Unos minutos después, una vez habéis puesto a [nor] al corriente..."
    "A few minutes later, once you've brought [nor] up to speed..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:486
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_b86cc6bb:

    # mc "Espero no haberme extralimitado diciéndoles que se pueden quedar una semana en tu casa."
    mc "I hope I didn't overstep my bounds by telling them they can stay at your place for a week."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:487
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_7069f4cf:

    # nor "¿Una semana? ¡Se pueden quedar todo el tiempo que quieran! Mientras no lleguen las estudiantes en otoño, esa habitación es suya si la quieren."
    nor "For a week? They can stay as long as they want! Since as the students don't arrive until the fall, that room is theirs if they want it."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:488
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_cbf508e3:

    # mc "Gracias, [nor]. Entre Meemaw, Tía Betty, y ahora Kiara y Eileen, casi es como si tuvieras a las estudiantes."
    mc "Thank you, [nor]. Between Meemaw, Aunt Betty, and now Kiara and Eileen, it's almost like you've got the students."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:490
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_98dcd74f:

    # nor "Me servirá de entrenamiento. *Risa* Scarlett se queda a dormir la mitad de los días. Cuando coincidan todas tendré cinco huespedes."
    nor "It will serve as a training ground for me. *Laugh* Scarlett sleeps over half the days. When she sleeps over I'll have five guests."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:492
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_14d1dee3:

    # mom "A mí me llega hoy la quinta. Por cierto, [mc], tienes que ir a buscarla al aeropuerto. Llega a las 2 PM."
    mom "I get my fifth one today. By the way, [mc], you have to pick her up at the airport. She arrives at 2 PM."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:493
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_f443373a:

    # mc "Sí, lo sé. Me lo dijo [nor] ayer. Parece que iba a ser una sorpresa para mí..."
    mc "Yes, I know. [nor] told me about it yesterday. It looks like it was going to be a surprise for me..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:495
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_60d7c644:

    # mom "¿Sorpresa? ¿Qué sorpresa?"
    mom "Surprise? What surprise?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:496
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_970f2e18:

    # mc "¿Te acuerdas de la chica India con la que salía en Portland? Estoy 99%% seguro de que es ella."
    mc "Do you remember the Indian girl I used to date in Portland? I'm 99\% sure it's her."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:511
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_0dcdc47b:

    # mom "¿Te ha seguido desde Portland? ¿Sin decírtelo?"
    mom "Has she followed you all the way from Portland? Without telling you?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:512
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_8a456377:

    # nor "Super romántico, ¿verdad? Estoy segura de que quiere volver con él."
    nor "Super romantic, right? I'm sure she wants to get back with him."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:513
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_75baeb1e:

    # mc "No estoy seguro, pero si no fuera así ¿por qué el secretismo? ¿Por qué se ha transferido a Newport?"
    mc "I'm not sure, but if it wasn't that, why the secrecy? Why did she transfer to Newport?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:515
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_f215b9b6:

    # mom "¿Tú quieres volver con ella?"
    mom "Do you want to go back to her?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:517
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_61e910c3:

    # mc "Mi situación es diferente de cuando estaba en Portland. Tengo que hablar con ella."
    mc "My situation is different from when I was in Portland. I need to talk to her."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:519
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_bb05ad6e:

    # mc "Hay muchas cosas que hacer en casa y no tengo demasiado tiempo para empezar o reanudar una relación. Tengo que hablar con ella."
    mc "There's a lot to do at home and I don't have too much time to start or resume a relationship. I have to talk to her."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:520
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_24b973a2:

    # mc "Pero volviendo al tema del día. Deberiais hablar con Eileen y Kiara. Les dije que os comentaría lo de la habitación y..."
    mc "But back to the topic of the day. You should talk to Eileen and Kiara. I told them I'd tell you about the room and..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:522
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_e020d34a:

    # nor "No hay nada que comentar. La habitación es suya por el tiempo que quieran."
    nor "There is nothing to discuss. The room is theirs for as long as they want it."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:523
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_495fef7c:

    # mc "Pero eso se les debería decir a ellas, no a mí. Yo ya sabía que no las íbamos a dejar en la estacada."
    mc "But you should tell that to them, not to me. I already knew we weren't going to leave them in the lurch."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:525
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_cc8a4499:

    # nor "¿Están despiertas?"
    nor "Are they awake?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:526
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_d74bb287:

    # mc "No lo sé, se acostaron tarde... Yo debería entrar para coger ropa y vestirme."
    mc "I don't know, they went to bed late, but I should go in to get clothes and get dressed."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:527
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_942c2998:

    # nor "Probemos entonces..."
    nor "Let's try it then..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:529
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:530
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_25c2df4d:

    # mc "Soy yo."
    mc "It's me."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:531
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_27e3a2b0:

    # kia "Entra, [mc]."
    kia "Come in, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:533
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_699dfc7a:

    # mc "Buenos días, Kiara. ¿Habéis dormido bien?"
    mc "Good morning, Kiara, did you sleep well?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:534
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_aaa33533:

    # kia "Sí, hemos dormido genial. Hacía tiempo que Eile y yo no compartíamos cama. Gracias por dejarnos tu habitación."
    kia "Yes, we slept great. It's been a while since Eile and I have shared a bed. Thanks for letting us have your room."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:536
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_03e1bae3:

    # mc "No se si recuerdas a mi madre y a mi tía."
    mc "I don't know if you remember my mother and aunt."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:537
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_38d0cbc6:

    # mom "Bienvenida a casa, Kiara. ¿Donde está Eileen? Hace siglos que no la veo. Siento mucho lo que te ha pasado. Lo que os ha pasado a las dos."
    mom "Welcome home, Kiara. Where's Eileen? I haven't seen her in ages. I'm so sorry for what happened to you... what happened to both of you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:538
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_84aeac3b:

    # nor "Hoy moveremos vuestras cosas a una habitación en mi casa, así [mc] puede recuperar la suya. Estaréis más cómodas allí, hay dos camas. Sentimos no poderos ofrecer más."
    nor "Today we'll move your things to a room in my house, so [mc] can get his back. You will be more comfortable there, there are two beds. We're sorry we can't offer you more."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:540
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_6265f88a:

    # kia "Gracias por acogernos, [mar] y [nor]. O lo que queda de ti, [nor]. Creo que si te viera por la calle no te reconocería. Nos conformamos con poco, solo serán unos días. No queremos molestar."
    kia "Thank you for hosting us, [mar] and [nor]. Or what's left of you, [nor]. I think if I saw you on the street I wouldn't recognize you. We need very little, it will only be a few days. We don't want to bother."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:541
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_add25c43:

    # kia "Eileen está en la ducha. Hoy empieza pronto en el trabajo y no cogió su bici. Tendrá que coger el autobús."
    kia "Eileen is in the shower. She has an early start at work today and she didn't take her bike. She'll have to take the bus."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:542
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_063f51fb:

    # mc "No te preocupes por eso. El café está de camino al hospital y la puedo llevar yo."
    mc "Don't worry about it. The cafe is on the way to the hospital and I can take her."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:544
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_0033c727:

    # kia "[mc], ya hablamos de eso anoche. No es necesario ir al hospital."
    kia "[mc], we talked about that last night. No need to go to the hospital."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:545
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_603a3173:

    # mc "No es necesario, pero sí recomendable. ¿Tienes algo mejor que hacer esta mañana? ¿A qué hora entras a trabajar?"
    mc "Not wanted, but recommended. Do you have something better to do this morning? What time do you start working?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:547
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_8db5c596:

    # kia "A la 1 PM. Voy a tener que mover nuestras cosas a la nueva habitación..."
    kia "At 1 PM. But I'm going to have to move our stuff to the new room..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:548
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_44c676ad:

    # mc "Las cosas son una bolsa de viaje tan solo, Kiara. La puedo llevar yo en cuanto Eileen salga de la ducha."
    mc "Your stuff is just a travel bag, Kiara. I can drop it off for you as soon as Eileen gets out of the shower."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:549
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_dcf18cd2:

    # mc "A las 10 AM tengo que estar en un sitio, a las 2 PM tengo que estar en el aeropuerto, tu trabajo me pilla de camino entre el hospital y el aeropuerto."
    mc "At 10 AM I have to be somewhere, at 2 PM I have to be at the airport, your work is on my way from the hospital to the airport."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:550
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_5d6577a8:

    # mc "Dejamos a Eileen en el café, vamos al hospital, me acompañas a lo que tengo que hacer a las 10, y te llevo al trabajo. Si tenemos tiempo, te invito a comer."
    mc "We can drop Eileen off at the cafe, go to the hospital, then you come with me to what I have to do at 10. Afterwards I will drive you to work. If we have time, I'll treat you to lunch."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:552
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_1778adbb:

    # mom "[mc] me ha dicho lo que ha pasado. Samantha Washington es una amiga, no va a hacer nada que tu no quieras hacer."
    mom "[mc] told me what happened. Samantha Washington is a friend, she's not going to do anything you don't want to do."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:553
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_e75bcff9:

    # mom "Si no quieres presentar la denuncia, no te va a obligar."
    mom "If you don't want to file the report, she's not going to force you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:555
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_ca34ffb5:

    # kia "¿Samantha Washington? ¿La madre del chico en... del chico que estudiaba en el mismo curso que Eileen y [mc]?"
    kia "Samantha Washington? The mother of the boy in... Of the boy who was in the same grade as Eileen and [mc]?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:556
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_5ce8450e:

    # mc "Sí, la madre de Jamaal."
    mc "Yes, Jamaal's mother."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:557
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_034bdae1:

    # kia "Sí, eso, Jamaal. No he hablado más que un par de veces con ella..."
    kia "Yeah, that's right, Jamaal. I haven't talked to her more than a couple of times..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:559
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_e364c13f:

    # nor "Pero es amiga de la familia. Y tú también. Si [mc] le pide algo..."
    nor "But she's a friend of the family. And so are you. If [mc] asks her for something..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:560
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_8ba27ce0:

    # mc "Entonces decidido, voy a ducharme y nos vamos cuando queráis."
    mc "So it's decided, I'm going to take a shower and we'll leave whenever you want."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:562
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_4c813a90:

    # eil "¿[nor]? ¡Estás fantástica!"
    eil "[nor]? You look fantastic!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:563
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_ba74b1db:

    # eil "Tu también, [mar]."
    eil "You too, [mar]."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:565
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_6423aeba:

    # mom "Bienvenida a casa, Eileen. Sabía que tarde o temprano te mudarías aquí, pero esperaba que fuera en otras circunstancias."
    mom "Welcome home, Eileen. I knew you'd move here sooner or later, but I was hoping it would be under different circumstances."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:566
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_5b7e94be:

    # eil "Gracias, [mar]. Yo también lo esperaba."
    eil "Thank you, [mar]. I was hoping for it too."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:568
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_b68411ed:

    # eil "Me parece increíble que haya pasado tanto tiempo sin veros. Tienes que entrar en el café cuando traigas a [eri] y lucir ese tipito."
    eil "It's amazing that it's been so long without seeing you. You need to get into the cafe when you drop [eri] in and show off that hot body you got."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:569
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_ba290689:

    # eil "¡Estás increíble! Me tienes que decir como has perdido tanto peso. No me iría mal a mí también."
    eil "You look amazing! You have to tell me how you lost so much weight. It want to lose some too."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:570
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_e4c672a7:

    # nor "Gracias, Eileen, pero tú no lo necesitas, a menos que quieras disfrazarte de esqueleto en Halloween. *Risa*"
    nor "Thanks, Eileen, but you don't need to, unless you want to dress up as a skeleton for Halloween. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:572
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_556e6162:

    # mom "Entonces, ¿vamos a desayunar mientras [mc] se ducha? Parece que va a tener un día ocupado"
    mom "So, shall we make breakfast while [mc] showers? Looks like he's going to have a busy day."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:573
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_dcc24a9d:

    # mc "A mí también me gustaría desayunar..."
    mc "I'd like to have breakfast too..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:575
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_ca074c8d:

    # nor "No te preocupes, te dejaremos algo para que desayunes. Ve a ducharte, ya llevaré yo la bolsa de Kiara y Eileen a casa."
    nor "Don't worry, we'll save some breakfast for you. Go take a shower, I'll bring Kiara and Eileen's bag home."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:577
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_b2a78d67:

    # nor "Si necesitáis algo de ropa, no dudéis en pedírnoslo a nosotras o a cualquiera de las chicas."
    nor "If you need any clothes, don't hesitate to ask us or any of the girls for them."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:579
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_9687e0a2:

    # kia "No te preocupes, podemos aguantar dos o tres días con lo que hemos traído. El jueves mi hija quiere ir a casa a coger más ropa."
    kia "Don't worry, we can make it two or three days with what we brought. Thursday my daughter wants to go home to get some more clothes."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:580
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_1f1380fa:

    # mc "El jueves por la noche no estará Solomon. Y esperamos poder llevar a Alexia... a la Agente Martínez por si se tuercen los planes."
    mc "Thursday night Solomon will be gone. And we hope to bring Alexia... Officer Martinez with us in case plans go awry."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:582
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_00d473fe:

    # mom "Ve a ducharte o llegaréis tarde. Nosotras vamos a seguir charlando en la cocina mientras preparamos el desayuno."
    mom "Go take that shower or you'll be late. We're going to keep chatting in the kitchen while we make breakfast."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:583
translate english c13s002_TalkToTheFamily_98b2ba8e:

    # mc "OK, os veo en la cocina."
    mc "OK, I'll see you in the kitchen."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:587
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_342c3ec7:

    # "Después de desayunar, llevas a Eileen al café y vas al hospital. Aparcas en la zona de visitantes."
    "After breakfast, you take Eileen to the cafe and go to the hospital. You park in the visitors' area."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:589
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_d3f5ff6a:

    # kia "[mc], de verdad que esto no es necesario. Tan solo es un hematoma."
    kia "[mc], this really isn't necessary. It's just a bruise."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:590
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_f29c0ae1:

    # mc "No hace mucho que yo tuve unos hematomas y me dijeron que podían ser peligrosos si no se trataban correctamente."
    mc "Not long ago I had some hematomas and was told that they could be dangerous if not treated correctly."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:591
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_02ce349c:

    # mc "No nos podemos arriesgar a que te pase nada, ¿verdad?"
    mc "We can't risk anything happening to you, can we?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:593
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_184d888d:

    # kia "Te conozco desde que tenías 15 años. Casi no reconozco a aquel chico tímido en este hombre que tengo ahora delante."
    kia "I've known you since you were 15. I almost don't recognize that shy boy in this man I have in front of me now."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:594
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_8d3cff4b:

    # mc "Kiara, sigo siendo yo. Tan solo he crecido y he adelgazado."
    mc "Kiara, I'm still the same guy. I've just grown up and gotten thinner."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:596
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_0c59923f:

    # kia "No me refiero a eso, [mc]. No quiero que te ofendas, pero al principio de salir con mi Eile me parecías un pusilánime."
    kia "That's not what I meant, [mc]. I don't want you to be offended, but at the beginning of dating my Eile you seemed like a pushover to me."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:597
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_34cf5b5c:

    # kia "No sé dónde tenías escondido a este hombre que toma las riendas de las situaciones."
    kia "I don't know where you had this man who takes charge of situations hiding."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:598
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_176ea40b:

    # mc "Creo que me lo había comido. *Risa*"
    mc "I think I ate him. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:600
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_fe4e84d0:

    # kia "*Risa* Eso no lo has perdido. Me sigues haciendo reír."
    kia "*Laugh* You haven't lost that. You still make me laugh."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:601
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_7682a1e6:

    # mc "¿Te parecía tan malo como dices?"
    mc "Did I seem as bad as you say?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:603
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_61516d06:

    # kia "Al principio sí. No me gustabas, pero la hacías feliz y por eso nunca me opuse a vuestra relación. Nunca le dije nada a ella."
    kia "At first yes. I didn't like you, but you made her happy and that's why I never objected to your relationship. I never told her anything about it."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:604
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_47c4bba0:

    # mc "Gracias. ¿Y después?"
    mc "Thank you. And then?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:606
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_67377fac:

    # kia "Después evolucionasteis los dos. Ella dejó de querer ser el centro de atención. Maduró gracias a ti."
    kia "Then you both evolved. She stopped wanting to be the focus of attention. She matured because of you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:607
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_32efa1d7:

    # kia "Tu dejaste de ser tan pusilánime, no encuentro una palabra mejor, pero sin perder tu esencia. Sacábais lo mejor del otro y hacíais que el otro enterrase lo peor de sí mismo."
    kia "You stopped being such a pushover, I can't find a better word, but without losing your essence. You brought out the best in each other and made each other bury the worst in themselves."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:608
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_21480074:

    # mc "No éramos una pareja para ser los reyes del baile, pero no nos iba mal. Nadie hubiera votado por mí como rey del baile entonces."
    mc "We weren't a couple to be prom kings, but we weren't doing badly. No one would have voted for me as prom king then."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:610
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_387b6b7f:

    # kia "No necesitabais serlo. Solomon y yo lo fuimos, y ya ves..."
    kia "You didn't need to be. Solomon and I were, and you can see..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:611
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_c48f9602:

    # mc "No te preocupes, Kiara. Si no quieres, no tienes que volver a verlo, y si quieres..."
    mc "Don't worry, Kiara. If you don't want to, you don't have to see him again, and if you want to..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:613
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_e8bbc76e:

    # kia "¡No! No voy a denunciarlo. Si no fuera por todo lo que me habéis dicho, no estaría aquí ni siquiera."
    kia "No! I'm not going to report him. If it wasn't for everything you guys have told me, I wouldn't even be here."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:614
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_5f32c172:

    # mc "No te iba a decir eso. Es tu decisión y, aunque no la comparta, tengo que respetarlo. Es tu familia."
    mc "I wasn't going to tell you that. It's your decision, and even if I don't agree with it, I have to respect it. It's your family."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:615
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_bfacd2fd:

    # mc "Iba a decirte que si querías podías quedarte en casa todo el tiempo que necesitaras."
    mc "I was going to tell you that if you wanted to you could stay at our place as long as you needed to."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:616
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_108d37e9:

    # mc "Hasta otoño tenéis disponible la habitación que ocuparéis. Y después podéis volver a dormir en mi cama."
    mc "Until fall, the room you will be in, is available. And then you can go back to sleeping in my bed."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:618
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_cda822c9:

    # kia "*Risa* Cualquiera que te oyera pensaría que hoy hemos dormido en tu cama contigo dentro. *Risa*"
    kia "*Laugh* Anyone who heard you would think we slept in your bed today with you in it. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:619
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_f0c2fba7:

    # mc "Bueno, en esa cama hemos dormido tres personas confortablemente. *Risa*"
    mc "Well, we have slept three people comfortably in that bed. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:620
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_059e8b1f:

    # mc "La entrada está ahí mismo. ¿Preparada?"
    mc "The entrance is right there - ready?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:622
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_405b7f9b:

    # kia "Sí. ¿Me aseguras que esa enfermera es de confianza? ¿No va a dar parte a la policía?"
    kia "Yes. Can you assure me that nurse is trustworthy? Isn't she going to report this to the police?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:623
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_d2670ae0:

    # mc "Kiara, Samantha es como una segunda madre para mí. No va a hacer nada que tu no quieras, pero me gustaría que comprobara como está ese brazo."
    mc "Kiara, Samantha is like a second mother to me. She's not going to do anything you don't want her to, but I'd like her to check on that arm."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:624
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_1e67f23d:

    # mc "Y si hace un informe que puedas usar si cambias de opinión, mejor."
    mc "And if she writes a report that you can use if you change your mind, so much the better."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:625
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_94d3a0e5:

    # kia "Vamos allá, entonces."
    kia "Let's go in, then."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:627
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_84bf76e9:

    # mc "Buenos días, Sam. Esta es Kiara, la madre de Eileen, no sé si la recuerdas."
    mc "Good morning, Sam. This is Kiara, Eileen's mother, I don't know if you remember her."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:628
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_01349ba5:

    # sam "Hola, [mc]. Encantada de volver a verte, Kiara. Hacía años que no coincidíamos. Voy a ser tu enfermera hoy."
    sam "Hello, [mc]. Nice to see you again, Kiara. It's been years since we've met. I'm going to be your nurse today."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:630
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_0f9fa27a:

    # kia "Hola, Samantha. No es nada grave, de verdad. [mc] está exagerando."
    kia "Hi, Samantha. It's nothing serious, really. [mc] is overreacting."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:631
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_5e3ef571:

    # mc "No exagero, tan solo soy precavido. Y ya has escuchado a Eileen, [nor] y [mar]."
    mc "I'm not overreacting, I'm just being cautious. And you already heard Eileen, [nor], and [mar]."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:633
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_9c807472:

    # sam "Un hematoma puede ser algo importante, más de lo que se piensa, no está de más echarle un ojo."
    sam "A hematoma can be a big deal, more than you think, it doesn't hurt to keep an eye on it."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:634
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_58787efe:

    # sam "Acompáñame, Kiara. Tú quédate aquí, [mc]. No eres familia y no puedes pasar. Normas del hospital."
    sam "Come with me, Kiara. You stay here, [mc]. You're not family and you can't come in. Hospital rules."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:635
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_98debacd:

    # mc "¿Para cuanto rato tenéis? Tengo que estar en otro sitio a las 10."
    mc "How much time it will take? I have to be somewhere else at 10."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:637
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_e773f8c7:

    # sam "Déjame echarle una ojeada y salgo a decírtelo."
    sam "Let me have a look at it and I'll come out and tell you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:638
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_22274886:

    # mc "Perfecto. Os espero aquí."
    mc "Perfect. I'll wait for you here."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:640
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_f02d5296:

    # kia "Una vez más, gracias, [mc]."
    kia "Once again, thank you, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:641
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_e7dbd164:

    # mc "Una vez más, no es necesario. Si me tengo que ir mientras estás con Samantha, te escribo o te llamo."
    mc "Once again, no need. If I have to leave while you're with Samantha, I'll text or call you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:643
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_820a6af0:

    # "Unos interminables minutos después..."
    "A few endless minutes later..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:644
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_38b199fb:

    # sam "El brazo tiene mala pinta y quiero que la vea un doctor y que ordene una radiografía, pero ahora mismo están muy ocupados. Se va a quedar un rato. Calcula un par de horas."
    sam "The arm looks bad and I want a doctor to see her and order an x-ray, but they're really busy right now. She's going to stay for a while. Figure a couple of hours."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:645
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_60c5fa7b:

    # mc "Vale, entonces voy a ir hacer unas cosas y vuelvo luego a buscarla."
    mc "Okay, I'm going to run some errands, then I'll come back later and get her."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:647
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_ba851d07:

    # sam "Perfecto. Le diré que la has abandonado en un hospital y que no volverás a buscarla. *Risa*"
    sam "Perfect. I'll tell her you've abandoned her in a hospital and you won't come back for her. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:649
translate english c13s002_TheHospital_74ed76d7:

    # mc "*Risa* Supongo que no me vas a dejar besarte aquí, ¿verdad?"
    mc "*Laugh* I guess you're not going to let me kiss you here, are you?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:651
