    # "El gesto en la cara de su madre muestra su enfado, tú también lo estarías si una de tus chicas acosara a tu hijo, si alguna vez lo tienes."
    "The frown on her mother's face shows her anger, you would be too if one of your girls harassed your son, if you ever have one."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:791
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_44a27d8d:

    # "El gesto en la cara de su madre muestra su enfado, tú también lo estarías si tu pareja acosara a tu hijo, si alguna vez lo tienes."
    "The frown on his mother's face shows her anger, you would be too if your partner harassed your child, if you ever have one."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:793
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_e7673eea:

    # "Solo conoces una frase en lenguaje de signos. Esa frase aparece varias veces. Siempre en manos de Scarlett, nunca de su madre."
    "You only know one sentence in sign language. That phrase appears several times. Always in Scarlett's hands, never in her mother's."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:794
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_72ac1e36:

    # "La conversación acaba abruptamente. Las dos están claramente enfadadas. Supones que con Kevin, pero mejor no preguntar."
    "The conversation ends abruptly. They're both clearly angry. You assume with Kevin, but you don't dare asking."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:796
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_d67c0f6f:

    # sca "Ya está. Dice que Kevin va a tardar poco en volver a casa y le preguntará sobre el video."
    sca "That's it. She says Kevin is going to be home shortly and she will ask him about the video."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:797
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_8be7e284:

    # mc "¿Le va a dar la oportunidad de negarlo?"
    mc "Is she going to give him a chance to deny it?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:798
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_59f6b087:

    # sca "Sí. Vamos a sentarnos a esperarlo."
    sca "Yes. Let's sit and wait for him."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:800
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_9317aa29:

    # "Está claro que durante la conversación las cosas se han caldeado entre madre e hija y ha acabado en enfado. Está claro que ninguna de las dos va a decir una palabra más."
    "It's clear that during the conversation things got heated between mother and daughter and ended up in anger. It's clear that neither one of them is going to say another word."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:801
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_d82fa969:

    # "Va a ser un silencio muy incómodo hasta que vuelva Kevin."
    "It's going to be a very awkward silence until Kevin comes back."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:803
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_d87a05b3:

    # "Por suerte, al cabo de unos minutos el móvil de la Señora Russell vibra."
    "Luckily, after a few minutes Mrs. Russell's cell phone buzzes."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:804
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_f10289eb:

    # "Lo mira y su cara se ilumina con una sonrisa."
    "She looks at it and her face lights up with a smile."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:805
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_96d0411e:

    # "No es buena señal."
    "Not a good sign."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:807
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_b5beb2e5:

    # kev "Hola, mi amor. Veo que tenemos visita."
    kev "Hello, my love. I see we have a visitor."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:809
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_d65b6379:

    # kev "Hola, soy Kevin Cameron. La pareja de esta preciosidad. Y prácticamente el padrastro de la otra belleza."
    kev "Hi, I'm Kevin Cameron. This beauty's partner. And practically the other cutie's stepfather."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:810
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_0e1968fd:

    # "No te levantas. No piensas estrechar su mano."
    "You don't get up. You don't want to shake his hand."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:811
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_b80feb7a:

    # "Lo que te apetecería hacer sería meter esos dientes perfectos en su estómago de un puñetazo y dejar su cara hecha pulpa por tus puños."
    "What you feel like doing is to sink those perfect teeth into his stomach with one punch and leave his face turned into pulp by your fists."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:812
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_70c8ad0c:

    # "Te cuesta retenerte de empezar a hacer zumo con sus ojos. Calma."
    "You're having a hard time restraining yourself from starting to make juice with his eyes. Calm down."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:813
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_bd7d9df9:

    # mc "[mc]."
    mc "[mc]."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:815
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_26927463:

    # kev "¿Ha pasado algo, cariño?"
    kev "Did something happen, honey?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:817
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_fab451ab:

    # mj "Mira este video, mi amor, por favor. Dime que no es cierto."
    mj "Watch this video, my love, please. Tell me it's not true."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:819
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_cfbdaf44:

    # kev "¿De qué va esto, mi vida?"
    kev "What's this about, darling?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:820
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_207f5f72:

    # mj "Míralo, por favor."
    mj "Watch it, please."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:821
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_8ca34c39:

    # "Kevin empieza a mirar el video con una cara de perplejidad."
    "Kevin starts watching the video with a puzzled look on his face."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:823
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_9d2a21fc:

    # "Su expresión cambia a sorpresa absoluta tal como pasan los segundos."
    "His expression changes to utter surprise just as the seconds tick by."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:825
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_d4774db5:

    # "Casi al final del video la sonrisa vuelve a su cara."
    "Near the end of the video the smile returns to her face."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:826
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_96d0411e_1:

    # "No es buena señal."
    "Not a good sign."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:828
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_fe059065:

    # kev "*Risa* Está muy bien hecho, pero como broma es un poco pesada."
    kev "*Laugh* It's very well done, but as a joke, it's a bad taste one."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:829
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_b3ba264f:

    # mcp "{i}(¿Que?){/i}"
    mcp "{i}(What?){/i}"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:830
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_898117f5:

    # kev "Además, este tipo tiene acento de Alabama, y ya sabes que yo soy de Tejas, cariño. No es mi voz."
    kev "Besides, this guy has an Alabama accent, and you know I'm from Texas, honey. It's not my voice."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:831
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_26b6669f:

    # "Tu perplejidad no hace más que aumentar. Es cláramente su voz y su acento. Tus ganas de machacarle la cara aumentan. Una bestia empieza a despertarse en tu interior. Calma."
    "Your perplexity only increases. It's clearly his voice and his accent. Your desire to smash his face increases. A beast begins to awaken inside you. Calm down."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:832
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_697275cf:

    # kev "*Risa* Lo que estos chicos son capaces de hacer con inteligencia artificial..."
    kev "*Laugh* What these kids are capable of doing with Artificial Intelligence..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:834
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_d14e9945:

    # mj "¿Entonces no es cierto? ¿Me lo juras?"
    mj "So it's not true? Do you swear it to me?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:835
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_0042774a:

    # kev "Por supuesto que te lo juro."
    kev "Of course I swear to you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:837
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_b2a49335:

    # mj "¡Lo sabía! No serías capaz de decir esas cosas."
    mj "I knew it! You wouldn't ever say such things to my girl."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:838
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_278b8aca:

    # kev "Por supuesto que no, cielo. Ya sabes que yo solo tengo ojos para ti."
    kev "Of course not, honey. You know I only have eyes for you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:840
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_dc0184ed:

    # mj "Señor Marks, no sé lo que esperaba conseguir con esta broma, pero no ha tenido ninguna gracia. Por favor, márchese de mi casa."
    mj "Mr. Marks, I don't know what you were hoping to accomplish with this joke, but it wasn't funny at all. Please leave my house."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:841
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_22450a82:

    # mc "Pero Señora Russell, le está mintiendo."
    mc "But Mrs. Russell, he's lying to you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:842
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_7a8d87e1:

    # mj "Cállese y váyase, por favor."
    mj "Shut up and get out of here, please."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:844
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_be008068:

    # mj "Tú y yo vamos a tener una larga conversación, niña."
    mj "You and I are going to have a long conversation, child."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:845
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_2d80d38b:

    # mc "*Susurrando* ¿Qué hago?"
    mc "*Whispering* What do I do?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:847
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_7cd63c8c:

    # sca "Vete, [mc]. Ya lo intentaré arreglar... como sea."
    sca "Go away, [mc]. I'll try to fix it... however I can."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:849
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_0ba03c0e:

    # kev "Ya te acompaño yo a la puerta, muchacho."
    kev "I'll walk you to the door, boy."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:850
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_d99273bb:

    # "La palabra \"muchacho\" va cargada de ironía. Te está diciendo que eres un niño que se ha metido en un juego de adultos al que no pertenece."
    "The word \"boy\" is loaded with irony. He's telling you that you're a kid who's gotten into an adult game where he doesn't belong."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:851
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_973610e2:

    # "Te cuesta mucho no dejar salir la bestia que está creciendo dentro de ti. Calma."
    "You're having a hard time not letting out the beast that's growing inside you. Calm down."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:853
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_0bf90338:

    # "Desde la puerta puedes ver cómo madre e hija discuten. Lo surrealista de la situación hace que casi sea gracioso ver a dos personas gritándose en silencio."
    "From the door you can see mother and daughter arguing. The surrealness of the situation makes it almost funny to watch two people silently yelling at each other."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:854
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_928dc63c:

    # kev "Mira, hijo, creía que solo iba a tener una noche a solas con esa putilla. Es demasiado perfecta para que la castiguen a menudo."
    kev "Listen, son, I thought I was only going to get one night alone with that little slut. She's too perfect to be punished often."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:855
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_9ac9e45d:

    # kev "Ahora, gracias a ti, me parece que voy a tener muchas noches a solas con ella. La próxima vez que la veas será toda una mujer."
    kev "Now, thanks to you, it looks to me like I'm going to have a lot of nights alone with her. Next time you see her she'll be a real woman."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:856
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_01a34171:

    # "Lisa estaría orgullosa de ti. Una bestia a la que has estado a punto de llevar a la extinción aparece con toda la furia de un animal aprisionado."
    "Lisa would be proud of you. A beast you've nearly driven to extinction shows up with all the fury of an imprisoned animal."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:858
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_56735bfc:

    # "Tu puño sale disparado hacia la boca de Kevin. No es un rodillo, pero hace el mismo efecto. No saltan dientes."
    "Your fist shoots out toward Kevin's mouth. It's not a rolling pin, but it does almost the same effect. No teeth pop out, though."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:860
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_310a016f:

    # "Scarlett y la Señora Rusell paran la discusión y os miran mientras Kevin cae al suelo."
    "Scarlett and Mrs. Russell stop the discussion and look at you as Kevin falls to the ground."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:861
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_f677d9f2:

    # mc "Scarlett, haz las maletas si quieres puedes venir a casa. No voy a dejarte con este cerdo."
    mc "Scarlett, pack your bags if you want to come home. I'm not leaving you with this rapist."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:863
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_25247a8f:

    # kev "¡Te voy a denunciar, hijo de puta! ¡Sé tu nombre!"
    kev "I'm going to report you, you son of a bitch! I know your name!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:865
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_cc6f8065:

    # mj "¡Haz tus maletas y vete de mi casa, Scarlett!"
    mj "Pack your bags and get out of my house, Scarlett!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:866
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_e44811be:

    # mj "¡No te quiero volver a ver en esta casa!"
    mj "I don't want to see you in this house again!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:867
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_92dacd4e:

    # sca "¿Qué?"
    sca "What?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:868
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_36b09a89:

    # "Nada está saliendo como habías planeado..."
    "Nothing is going as you had planned..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:870
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_04a98fcd:

    # mj "¡Lo que has oído! ¡Primero me destrozas la vida!"
    mj "You heard me! First, you wrecked my life!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:871
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_2a04d9fb:

    # mj "¡Después tu padre deja de mandarme dinero!"
    mj "Then your father stops sending me money!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:872
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_14f46e82:

    # mj "¡Ahora traes a tu amigo para que apalice a Kevin, con lo bueno que ha sido con nosotras! ¡Fuera de aquí!"
    mj "Now you're bringing your friend in to beat up Kevin, as good as he's been to us! Get out of here!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:873
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_23c9d6e2:

    # sca "¿Qué estás diciendo? ¿Has estado recibiendo dinero de mi padre todos estos años?"
    sca "What are you saying? You've been getting money from my father all these years?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:874
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_4fec626a:

    # "El tiempo parece haberse detenido para Kevin y para ti. Seguir la pelea hubiera sido lógico. Observar a las dos mujeres gritarse es más interesante."
    "Time seems to have stood still for Kevin and you. Following the fight would have been logical. Watching the two women scream at each other is more interesting."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:876
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_65aed982:

    # mj "¡Sí! ¡Y me alegra habértelo ocultado! No te mereces nada."
    mj "Yes! And I'm glad I kept it from you! You don't deserve anything."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:877
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_a7e99f3c:

    # sca "¡Pues lo buscaré e iré con él! Seguro que estaré mejor con él que contigo. Siempre pensando solo en el dinero y creyendo antes a Kevin que a tu hija."
    sca "Then I'll find him and go to live with him! I'm sure I'll be better off with him than with you. Always thinking only of money and believing Kevin over your daughter."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:879
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_3c731fe7:

    # mj "Suerte con eso. Me escribió hace unos días. Como ya tienes 18, no va a mandar más dinero."
    mj "Good luck with that. He wrote to me a few days ago. Since you're already 18, he's not going to send any more money."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:880
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_e11e2a40:

    # mj "Eso es lo que te quiere y se preocupa por ti, mientras yo he sacrificado mi vida por tenerte."
    mj "That shows how much he loves you and cares for you, while I've sacrificed my life to have you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:881
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_6092ea65:

    # "*Ding-Dong*"
    "*Ding-Dong*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:883
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_3ce3d494:

    # "El móvil de la Señora Russell vuelve a vibrar. El timbre os paraliza a todos durante unos segundos."
    "Mrs. Russell's phone buzzes again. The ringing paralyzes you all for a few seconds."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:884
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_6092ea65_1:

    # "*Ding-Dong*"
    "*Ding-Dong*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:885
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_6092ea65_2:

    # "*Ding-Dong*"
    "*Ding-Dong*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:887
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_f326ad6a:

    # "La Señora Russell va a abrir la puerta. Esquiva el cuerpo de Kevin en el suelo. Si no fuera por eso, parecería que no ha pasado nada para ella. "
    "Mrs. Russell walks to open the door. She dodges Kevin's body on the floor. If it weren't for that, it would look like nothing had happened. "

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:888
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_1795085c:

    # "La persona más inesperada está fuera."
    "The most unexpected person is waiting outside."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:890
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_475ffd53:

    # ama "FBI. Apártese, Señora Russell."
    ama "FBI. Step aside, Mrs. Russell."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:891
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_388905bb:

    # ama "¡[mc] Marks, queda detenido por infracciones contra la Ley de Pivacidad en el Hogar!"
    ama "[mc] Marks, you are under arrest for violations against the Home Privacy Act!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:892
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_bb4742bf:

    # mcp "{i}(No puede ser. Es igualita que [emm]... si no fuera por el pelo... y por que se la ve mucho más adulta que a [emm]...){/i}"
    mcp "{i}(No way. She looks just like [emm]... if it wasn't for the hair... and for the fact that she looks much more mature than [emm]...){/i}"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:893
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_8920c9e4:

    # mc "Ama..."
    mc "Ama..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:894
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_e24ee8e5:

    # ama "¡Silencio! De rodillas. ¡Las manos detras de la espalda!"
    ama "Silence! On your knees. Hands behind your back!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:895
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_8a825d46:

    # "Sigues sus instrucciones. No sabes de qué va esto."
    "You follow her instructions. You don't know what's going on here."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:897
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_6cbf7c7c:

    # "Mientras Amanda te esposa..."
    "While Amanda handcuffs you..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:898
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_7a1b5cd4:

    # ama "*Susurrando* No te preocupes..."
    ama "*Whispering* Don't worry..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:899
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_65204ccf:

    # kev "También me ha agredido..."
    kev "He also assaulted me..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:901
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_50dcfcc7:

    # ama "Eso se sumará a la lista de cargos. Acompáñeme junto con la Señora Russell, por favor. Tengo que tomarles declaración."
    ama "That will be added to the list of charges. Join me along with Mrs. Russell, please. I have to take your statements."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:903
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_47a4ca7e:

    # "Amanda desaparece con la Señora Russell y Kevin. Ambos están en shock."
    "Amanda disappears with Mrs. Russell and Kevin. They are both in shock."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:904
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_6b90c0b1:

    # sca "¿Esa era... [emm]?"
     sca "That was.... [emm]?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:905
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_a00cff2a:

    # mc "No, pero ahora no te lo puedo explicar. Ayúdame con las esposas."
    mc "No, but I can't explain it to you now. Help me with the handcuffs."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:907
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_cc394469:

    # sca "No tengo ni idea de como abrirlas... "
    sca "I have no idea how to open them.... "

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:908
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_4277e4fe:

    # mc "No te preocupes, Ama... la falsa [emm] va a volver ahora... está de nuestra... de mi parte. Ayúdame a levantarme."
    mc "Don't worry, Ama... the faux [emm] is coming back now... she's on our... on my side. Help me up."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:910
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_78d87fc9:

    # ama "Scarlett, ve a hacer las maletas. Tienes un par de horas. No creo que pueda entretenerlos mucho más antes de que empiecen a sospechar."
    ama "Scarlett, go pack your bags. You have a couple of hours. I don't think I can stall them much longer before they get suspicious."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:911
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_cfe0f18d:

    # "Su voz transpira autoridad. Pero Scarlett ya no es la niña tímida de hace dos semanas. Algo ha cambiado en ella."
    "Her voice exudes authority. But Scarlett is no longer the shy girl she was two weeks ago. Something has changed in her."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:913
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_9037a408:

    # sca "¿Por qué? ¿Y quién eres? Tienes la cara de [emm], pero ahí acaba el parecido."
    sca "Why? And who are you? You have [emm]'s face, but that's where the resemblance ends."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:914
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_ad5f40e7:

    # mc "Scarlett, ya te he dicho que no te lo podía explicar ahora..."
    mc "Scarlett, I already told you I couldn't explain it to you now..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:917
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_82bd4e59:

    # ama "Será mejor que hagas caso a tu novio, Scarlett."
    ama "You'd better listen to your boyfriend, Scarlett."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:919
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_529e2605:

    # ama "Será mejor que hagas caso a [mc], Scarlett."
    ama "You'd better listen to [mc], Scarlett."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:920
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_e520b6e2:

    # ama "Si dejo a tu madre y a Kevin mucho rato solos saldrán del estado de shock y empezarán a notar que hay cosas que no cuadran."
    ama "If I leave your mother and Kevin alone too long they will come out of shock and start to notice that there are things that don't add up."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:922
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_27bcf464:

    # sca "Tienes razón. Los agentes del FBI siempre van por parejas en las películas, y has dejado a un sospechoso sin vigilancia. Mi madre no es tonta y lo notará."
    sca "You're right. FBI agents always go in pairs in the movies, and you've left a suspect unattended. My mother is not stupid and she'll notice."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:923
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_2f91c156:

    # sca "Voy a hacer las maletas y ahora vuelvo."
    sca "I'm going to pack my bags and I'll be right back."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:925
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_2e295c3e:

    # "Un minuto después, una vez retiradas las esposas..."
    "One minute later, once Amanda removed the handcuffs...."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:926
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_7049495e:

    # ama "¡Joder! Cuando te mandamos el video creíamos que ibas a usar a Jamaal para hacerlo viral en MeTube o llevárselo a Alexia. No esto."
    ama "Fuck! When we sent you the video we thought you were going to use Jamaal to make it viral on MeTube or bring it to Alexia. Not this."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:927
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_947cf5cd:

    # ama "He venido en cuanto he deducido que tu plan no iba a funcionar."
    ama "I came as soon as I deduced that your plan wasn't going to work."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:928
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_805f55e4:

    # mc "Creía que esto podía solucionarlo todo... Al menos hoy te ha dado tiempo de quitarte el mono de mecánico..."
    mc "I thought this could solve the issue... At least today you had time to get the mechanic's overalls off..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:929
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_36417800:

    # mc "¿Desde cuándo tenéis cámaras en casa de Scarlett? ¿Hay otros videos donde se vea la cara de Kevin y la Señora Russell pueda leer sus labios?"
    mc "Since when do you guys have cameras at Scarlett's house? Are there other videos where Kevin's face is showing and Mrs. Russell can read his lips?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:931
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_24b0910e:

    # ama "No, lo siento. Las pusimos el domingo, cuando Scarlett fue a comprar al supermercado..."
    ama "No, sorry. We set them up on Sunday, when Scarlett went grocery shopping..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:933
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_b609be58:

    # mc "Entonces tenéis grabado..."
    mc "So you have recorded..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:934
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_a62755ee:

    # ama "Sí, pero destruímos todo lo que no es importante para la misión..."
    ama "Yes, but we destroy everything that is not important for the mission..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:936
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_424ad18e:

    # mc "Lástima... pero ¿por qué vigilar la casa de Scarlett?"
    mc "Too bad... but why watch Scarlett's house?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:937
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_f2975f2e:

    # ama "Podía ser importante para la misión... y destruimos lo que no es importante."
    ama "It could be important to the mission... and we destroy what is not important."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:938
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_ae4af940:

    # ama "{i}(O lo copiamos a discos privados.){/i}"
    ama "{i}(Or we copy it to private disks.){/i}"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:939
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_3fddcc67:

    # mc "Y no me vas a decir cual es esa misión, ¿verdad? ¿Tiene algo que ver con la cláusula NG?"
    mc "And you're not going to tell me what that mission is, are you? Does it have anything to do with the NG clause?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:941
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_76e960e9:

    # ama "{b}¿Qué?{/b} ¿Dónde has oído eso? "
    ama "{b}What?{/b} Where did you hear that?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:942
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_d881f221:

    # mc "Vosotras tenéis vuestros secretos y yo los míos. Cuando quieras intercambiamos información."
    mc "You have your secrets and I have mine. Anytime you want to exchange information, let me know."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:943
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_39cc3e0d:

    # mc "{i}(OK. No tienen acceso a mi ordenador o no son capaces de romper el cifrado de Jamaal.){/i}"
    mc "{i}(OK. They don't have access to my computer or are unable to break Jamaal's encryption.){/i}"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:945
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_01ede65e:

    # ama "Me parece justo. Mañana o pasado nos pondremos en contacto con vosotros para hablar."
    ama "Fair enough. We'll get back to you tomorrow or the next day to talk."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:946
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_65abb11e:

    # ama "Voy a llevarme a la Señora Russell y a Kevin o van a empezar a sospechar. Les voy a decir que estás detenido, con lo que mejor que no pases por este barrio en unos días."
    ama "I'm going to take Mrs. Russell and Kevin with me or they're going to get suspicious. I'm going to tell them you're under arrest, so you better not come through this neighborhood for a few days."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:947
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_776dbc69:

    # mc "Sólo una pregunta más. ¿Por qué me habéis enviado el video? Scarlett no tiene nada que ver con NTR o con GILF."
    mc "Just one more question. Why did you guys send me the video? Scarlett has nothing to do with NTR or GILF."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:949
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_1a22ac27:

    # ama "Porque pensamos que podía ser importante. Especialmente para ti... y para [dap]... aunque no tenga nada que ver con la misión. Y porque Kevin es un cerdo."
    ama "Because we thought it might be important. Especially to you... and to [dap]... even though it has nothing to do with the mission. And because Kevin is a pig."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:950
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_b2516466:

    # mc "Gracias."
    mc "Thank you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:952
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_514c8615:

    # ama "No tienes que darlas. Saca a Scarlett de aquí en cuanto puedas."
    ama "You don't have to thank me... us. Get Scarlett out of here as soon as you can."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:953
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_b69bbafa:

    # ama "No sabía lo del dinero de su padre, pero parece que era una de las razones por la que la Señora Russell no la ha echado antes."
    ama "I didn't know about her father's money, but it seems that was one of the reasons Mrs. Russell didn't kick her out sooner."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:954
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_318d4368:

    # ama "Nos veremos pronto. Buen puñetazo, por cierto."
    ama "We'll see you soon. Nice punch, by the way."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:956
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_0f479e29:

    # "Haces una llamada a [nor] y, después de confirmar la que pensabas que sería su respuesta, vas a la habitación de Scarlett."
    "You make a call to [nor] and, after confirming what you thought would be her answer, you go to Scarlett's room."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:958
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_6d700f97:

    # mc "¿Necesitas ayuda?"
    mc "Do you need any help?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:959
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_ac751ecc:

    # sca "No sé por donde empezar. He cogido la ropa... y... y..."
    sca "I don't know where to start. I've taken the clothes... and... and..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:960
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_b3df5efd:

    # mc "Ven aquí."
    mc "Come here."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:962
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_e808086f:

    # sca "No tengo ni idea de qué voy a hacer... de dónde voy a vivir... estoy sin blanca..."
    sca "I have no idea what I'm going to do... where I'm going to live... I'm penniless..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:963
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_1d01af04:

    # mc "No te preocupes por eso. Acabo de hablar con [nor] y con [dap]. Les he explicado lo que ha pasado... al menos parte. He obviado lo del video."
    mc "Don't worry about it. I just talked to [nor] and [dap]. I've explained to them what happened... at least part of it. I've skipped the video thing."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:964
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_8b4e277b:

    # mc "Puedes vivir en casa de [nor], si no te importa compartir habitacion con [dap]."
    mc "You can live at [nor]'s house, if you don't mind sharing a room with [dap]."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:966
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_de3bf20f:

    # sca "¿Que has hecho {b}qué{/b}?"
    sca "You've done {b}what{/b}?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:967
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_226564a3:

    # mc "Sí, Scarlett. No tienes que preocuparte de dónde vas a vivir. Casi eres parte de la familia..."
    mc "Yes, Scarlett. You don't have to worry about where you're going to live. You're almost part of the family..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:970
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_9f2f97ad:

    # sca "Te quiero. Gracias."
    sca "I love you. Thank you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:971
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_95625d17:

    # mc "Y yo a ti. Pasabas la mitad de las noches allí. Ahora serán todas."
    mc "And I love you. You used to spend half your nights there. Now it will be all of them."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:974
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_2a24d1ed:

    # sca "Gracias, [mc]."
    sca "Thank you, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:975
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_9b5f1825:

    # mc "No tienes por que darlas. Pasabas la mitad de las noches allí. Ahora serán todas."
    mc "No need to thank me. You used to spend half your nights there. Now it will be all of them."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:976
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_04554e14:

    # mc "Vamos a acabar de recoger tus cosas y las llevamos a la camioneta."
    mc "Let's finish getting your stuff and take them to the pickup truck."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:978
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_f65fe139:

    # sca "Pero ¿qué me llevo? Toda mi vida está en esta habitación..."
    sca "But what am I taking? My whole life is in this room..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:979
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_7db5c2cf:

    # mc "Todo lo que quieras conservar."
    mc "Anything you want to keep."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:981
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_e16aa35c:

    # mc "Todo lo que quieras llevarte de esta vida a la que vas a empezar en casa."
    mc "Everything you want to take with you from this life to the one you're going to start at home."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:983
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_a1efddeb:

    # mc "Tus fotos y pósters..."
    mc "Your pictures and posters..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:985
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_bd3a184f:

    # mc "Discos, libros..."
    mc "Discs, books..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:986
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_200e44b7:

    # mc "Cualquier cosa que quieras conservar. La parte de atrás de la camioneta está vacía. Voy a ir llevando el tocadiscos mientras decides que llevar."
    mc "Anything you want to keep. The back of the truck is empty. I'll go carry the record player while you decide what to take."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:988
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_6aba73a2:

    # "Una hora después, tras varios viajes a la camioneta y una llamada de teléfono..."
    "An hour later, after several trips to the pickup truck and a phone call..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:989
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_3201de0e:

    # sca "Ya está todo. Nos podemos ir."
    sca "That's it. We can go."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:990
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_4dab87e9:

    # mc "Despídete de esta casa, Scarlett. ¿Lo llevamos todo?"
    mc "Say goodbye to this house, Scarlett. Are we taking everything?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:992
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_74dca989:

    # sca "Sí, no queda nada ahí que quiera conservar. Una parte de mí la va a echar de menos. Otra parte mayor... no."
    sca "Yeah, there's nothing left in there that I want to keep. Part of me is going to miss it. Another bigger part... not."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:993
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_7aa1096f:

    # sca "Saber que mi madre me ha estado ocultando cosas, que ha estado en contacto con mi padre todo este tiempo... que ha creído a Kevin antes que a mí..."
    sca "Knowing that my mother has been hiding things from me, that she's been in contact with my father all this time... that she believed Kevin over me..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:994
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_bdab500e:

    # mc "Sé que es difícil de digerir, pero vas a vivir con nosotros. Te vamos a ayudar entre todos."
    mc "I know it's hard to digest, but you're going to live with us. We're going to help you, all of us."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:996
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_000e092e:

    # sca "Gracias, [mc], una vez más."
    sca "Thank you, [mc], once again."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:997
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_978ec110:

    # mc "No tienes por qué darlas. Pero nos tenemos que ir. Las nuevas inquilinas nos estarán esperando."
    mc "Once again, you don't need to thank me. But we have to go. The new tenant will be waiting for us."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:999
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_89ac21b9:

    # sca "Es verdad, hoy llegaba la última estudiante del verano."
    sca "That's true, today the last student of the summer course was arriving, right?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1000
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_e944ed7a:

    # mc "Sí, pasamos por el hospital a recoger a Kiara y vamos al aeropuerto a buscarla. Su vuelo llega en una hora."
    mc "Yes, we'll stop by the hospital to pick up Kiara and go to the airport to pick the student up. Her flight arrives in two hours."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1002
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_ad060bf5:

    # sca "¿Kiara?"
    sca "Kiara?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1003
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_b1268ea3:

    # mc "Ahora la conocerás. Creo que te va a gustar."
    mc "You'll meet her in ten minutes. I think you're going to like her."

translate english strings:

    # game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:354
    old "Podrías conseguir a cualquier chica que quisieras."
    new "You could get any girl you want."

    # game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:354
    old "Sólo fue un golpe de suerte."
    new "It was just a lucky break."

    # game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1235
    old "Ruta con Saira abierta."
    new "Saira's path open."

    # game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1236
    old "Ruta con Saira cerrada de momento."
    new "Saira's path closed for now"

    # game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1237
    old "¿Dónde le das el beso?"
    new "Where do you kiss her?"

    # game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1237
    old "En los labios."
    new "On the lips."

    # game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1237
    old "En la mejilla."
    new "On the cheek"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:259
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_b919e696_1:

    # eil "No te tienes que esconder de mi madre para besarme. Ni de mi madre ni de nadie. Soy una adulta y puedo besar a quien quiera. Y al único que quiero besar es a ti."
    eil "You don't have to hide from my mother to kiss me. Not from my mother or anyone else. I'm an adult and I can kiss whoever I want. And the only one I want to kiss is you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:260
translate english c13s001_KiaraEileen_a4eab181_1:

    # eil "Si necesitas decirle a alguien que salimos juntos, puedes hacerlo. Yo tampoco me tengo que esconder."
    eil "If you need to tell someone we're dating, you can. I don't have to hide that either."


# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:755
translate english c13s003_ScarlettHouse_548965d0:

    # sca "Espera y lee lo que dice ahora..."
    sca "Wait and read what he says now..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:998
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_5ef2e59f:

    # sca "¿Quién es? ¿La conozco? No me suena el nombre."
    sca "Who is she? Do I know her? The name doesn't ring a bell."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:999
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_b6297da9:

    # mc "Es la madre de Eileen. Va a vivir unos días con vosotras, en casa de [nor]."
    mc "She's Eileen's mother. She's going to live with us for a few days, at [nor]'s house."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1001
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_e8600231:

    # sca "¿Eileen también?"
    sca "Eileen too?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1002
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_157800dc:

    # mc "Sí, ¿por qué lo preguntas?"
    mc "Yes. Why do you ask?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1005
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_a7826cfb:

    # sca "Tan solo por curiosidad. Hace un tiempo me hubiera puesto celosa por saber que Eileen iba a vivir en tu casa... más o menos..."
    sca "Just out of curiosity. A while ago I would have been jealous to know Eileen was going to live in your house... sort of..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1007
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_b0adc982:

    # sca "Ahora que sé que estás saliendo con otras chicas, casi me alegraría que Eileen fuera una de ellas... y no, no estoy preguntando si lo es."
    sca "Now that I know you're dating other girls, I'd almost be glad if Eileen was one of them... and no, I'm not asking if she is."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1008
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_51746308:

    # mc "Eso se lo tendrás que preguntar a ella. A ser posible conmigo delante. *Risa* Su cara puede ser muy divertida {b}si{/b} no estoy con ella."
    mc "You'll have to ask her. If possible with me there. *Laugh* Her face can be very funny {b}if{/b} I'm not with her."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1010
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_c76f8262:

    # sca "Ahora que estás saliendo conmigo, me da lo mismo quien viva contigo... con nosotros..."
    sca "Now that you're dating me, I don't care who lives with you... with us..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1011
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_32afb495:

    # mc "Scarlett, ahora mismo solo me importas tú. No me importa quién viva en casa."
    mc "Scarlett, right now I only care about you. I don't care who lives at home."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1014
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_44fd8b13:

    # sca "Tan solo por curiosidad. Tú y yo no vamos a estar juntos nunca, con lo que no debo ponerme celosa por que tu ex viva en tu casa... más o menos..."
    sca "Just out of curiosity. You and I are never going to be together, so I shouldn't be jealous of your ex living in your house... sort of..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1015
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_efc8d372:

    # mc "Scarlett, ya lo hemos hablado. No sería justo para ninguno de los dos, lo único que harías es hacerte daño."
    mc "Scarlett, we've been over this. It wouldn't be fair to either of us, all you'd be doing is hurting yourself."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1016
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_476b8ad5:

    # sca "Lo sé, pero no por ello es más fácil."
    sca "I know, but that doesn't make it any easier."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1018
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_d2307d68:

    # sca "Si puedo preguntar, ¿por qué se han mudado a casa de [nor]?"
    sca "If I may ask, why have they moved to [nor]'s house?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1019
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_e3304c3c:

    # mc "Por la misma razón que tú. Han tenido problemas en casa, y les hemos ofrecido un sitio donde quedarse. De momento se quedarán una semana."
    mc "For the same reason as you. They have had problems at home, and we have offered them a place to stay. They will stay for a week or so for the time being."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1020
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_643a6609:

    # sca "Supongo que no vas a entrar en detalles igual que no entrarías si alguien te preguntará por qué me he mudado yo."
    sca "I guess you're not going to go into details just like you wouldn't go into details if someone asked you why I moved myself."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1021
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_a4c22620:

    # mc "Exacto. Creo que cada una de vosotras tiene derecho a explicar lo que quiera a quién quiera."
    mc "Exactly. I think each of you has the right to explain whatever you want to whomever you want."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1023
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_a843553c:

    # sca "Y cambiando de tema... ¿quién es la falsa [emm]?"
    sca "And changing the subject.... who is the faux [emm]?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1024
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_85a9d95c:

    # mc "Aún no estoy muy seguro. De momento te puedo decir que las dos veces que la he visto ha aparecido para ayudar. Fue ella la que mandó el video."
    mc "I'm not quite sure yet. At the moment I can tell you that the two times I've seen her, she has shown up to help. She was the one who sent the video."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1025
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_036ff51c:

    # mc "Me ha dicho que en uno o dos días se pondrá en contacto con la familia para aclarar las cosas... supongo..."
    mc "She told me that in a day or two she'll be in touch with the family to clear things up... I guess..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1027
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_de8df744:

    # sca "¿Cómo sabía lo que estaba pasando? ¿También hay cámaras en el salón?"
    sca "How did she know what was going on? Are there cameras in the living room too?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1028
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_af4565c7:

    # mc "Creo que la casa de tu madre tiene cámaras por todos lados..."
    mc "I think your mother's house has cameras all over the place...."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1030
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_cfc8099c:

    # mcp "{i}(Mejor no decirle que nos grabaron el domingo. Si han destruído el video, no hay de qué preocuparse.){/i}"
    mcp "{i}(Better not tell her we were recorded on Sunday. If they destroyed the video, there's nothing to worry about.){/i}"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1031
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_ce92fc45:

    # mc "Ya estamos llegando al hospital. Ahora te presento a Kiara y vamos a comer."
    mc "We are arriving at the hospital. Now let me introduce you to Kiara and let's have lunch."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1033
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_b831fce0:

    # mc "Hola, Kiara. Sube."
    mc "Hello, Kiara. Come on in."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1035
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_58b194a6:

    # mc "¿Cómo ha ido? ¿Qué tal te ha tratado Sam?"
    mc "How did it go? How did Sam treat you?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1036
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_358f76fc:

    # kia "Mal y bien. El hematoma es señal de un pequeño desgarro muscular. Samantha ha sido un cielo, me ha dado un ungüento."
    kia "Bad and fine. The bruise is a sign of a small muscle tear. Samantha has been a sweetheart, she gave me some ointment."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1037
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_2893d567:

    # mc "Por cierto, Scarlett - Kiara, Kiara - Scarlett."
    mc "By the way, Scarlett - Kiara, Kiara - Scarlett."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1038
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_32eb5c67:

    # kia "Encantada, Scarlett."
    kia "Nice to meet you, Scarlett."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1040
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_a1ed0ab0:

    # sca "Igualmente, Kiara. Me ha dicho [mc] que somos las nuevas inquilinas. Yo también me mudo hoy."
    sca "Likewise, Kiara. [mc] told me that we are the new tenants. I'm moving in today, too."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1042
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_5287ccd9:

    # kia "¡Oh! ¿Eres la nueva estudiante? Creía que tu vuelo llegaba más tarde..."
    kia "Oh! Are you the new student? I thought your flight was arriving later..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1043
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_7bd44854:

    # mc "No, Scarlett es una amiga de la familia. Se va a mudar a la habitación de [dap]. A la estudiante la irémos a buscar después de dejarte en el trabajo."
    mc "No, Scarlett is a family friend. She's moving into [dap]'s room. We'll pick up the new student after we drop you off at work."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1045
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_20e889df:

    # kia "Genial, me extrañaba que hubiera volado con tantas cajas."
    kia "Great, I was surprised that she flew with so many boxes."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1046
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_0d285e83:

    # kia "No me va a dar tiempo de comer con vosotros. Voy a llegar un poco justa."
    kia "I won't have time to have lunch with you. I'm going to be a little late."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1047
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_7f73e754:

    # mc "Aún nos queda un rato. Conozco un sitio al lado de tu trabajo. O conocía antes de ir a la universidad... no sé si el puesto de perritos seguirá ahí."
    mc "We still have a little time left. I know a place next to your work. Or I knew before I went to college... I don't know if the hot dog stand is still there."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1049
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_7e424464:

    # kia "Sí, sigue ahí. Dejadme invitaros a comer."
    kia "Yes, it's still there. Let me buy you guys lunch."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1050
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_0e6f0b92:

    # mc "He sido yo quién te ha dicho que te invitaría a comer, con lo que no voy a aceptar que pagues tú."
    mc "It was me who told you I'd invite you to lunch, so I'm not going to accept that you pay for it."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1051
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_db027e54:

    # mc "Scarlett, ¿te gustan los perritos?"
    mc "Scarlett, do you like hot dogs?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1053
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_5233075e:

    # sca "¡Me encantan!"
    sca "I love them!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1054
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_8758fbc0:

    # mc "Entonces no se hable más. Perritos para todos."
    mc "Then it's settled. Hot dogs for everyone."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1056
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_a94a922f:

    # "Unos perritos después..."
    "Some hot dogs later..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1057
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_e4c4cefc:

    # sca "Y esa es mi historia y por qué de me estoy mudando..."
    sca "And that's my story and why I'm moving..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1058
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_06996d74:

    # mcp "{i}(Has hecho bien en omitir lo del video. Habría que dar muchas explicaciones a Kiara y querría hablar con Amanda antes. O con Eva.){/i}"
    mcp "{i}(You have done well to omit the video thing. There would be a lot of explaining to do to Kiara and I'd want to talk to Amanda first. Or to Eva.){/i}"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1060
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_8453653e:

    # kia "Lo siento mucho, Scarlett. Yo creía que lo mío era malo, pero lo tuyo es horrible."
    kia "I'm so sorry, Scarlett. I thought my issue was bad, but yours is horrible."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1061
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_360b7833:

    # kia "No sé si es peor lo de Kevin o que te haya ocultado que ha estado en contacto con tu padre."
    kia "I don't know if the worst thing is the Kevin part or that she kept it from you that she's been in contact with your father."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1062
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_2cf9c70c:

    # mcp "(Es sorprendente lo rápido que han encajado estas dos. Las dos lo han pasado mal y a Kiara le ha salido la vena maternal y protectora en cuanto se han explicado sus historias.)"
    mcp "(It's amazing how quickly these two have clicked. They've both had a hard time, and Kiara's maternal and protective streak has come out as soon as their stories have been explained.)"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1064
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_14d8115c:

    # sca "Lo más peligroso ha sido lo de Kevin. Lo que más me ha dolido ha sido lo de mi padre."
    sca "The most dangerous thing was Kevin. The one that hurt the most was the part about my father."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1065
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_a1e52128:

    # sca "Ella sabe lo importante que ha sido para mí saber quién es durante todos estos años. Ocultarmelo ha sido... doloroso."
    sca "She knew how important it had been for me to know who he was all these years. Hiding it from me has been... painful."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1067
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_354746d2:

    # mcp "{i}(Si mis sospechas son ciertas, no tendrás que esperar mucho para saberlo, aunque sea un saco de mierda.){/i}"
    mcp "{i}(If my suspicions are correct, you won't have to wait long to find out who he is, even if he is a scumbag.){/i}"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1069
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_dd9e5fa2:

    # kia "Yo podría hacer algo al respecto si la cosa se pusiera fea, pero tú lo tienes más complicado con lo de Kevin. Sin pruebas..."
    kia "I could do something about it if it got ugly, but it's harder for you with Kevin. Without proof..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1070
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_3222cbfa:

    # mc "Ahora solo hace falta que quieras hacerlo antes de que se ponga demasiado fea."
    mc "Now all you need to do is to want to do something before it gets too ugly."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1072
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_fb4a8f13:

    # kia "No insistas, [mc]. No quiero poner la denuncia. Ha sido la primera vez en 3 años, creo que se va a asustar lo suficiente con que nos hayamos marchado como para repetirlo."
    kia "Don't push it, [mc]. I don't want to file a police report. It was the first time in 3 years. I think, because we left, he's going to be scared enough to don't do it again."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1073
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_ff89f607:

    # mc "No estoy insistiendo, Kiara. Al menos ahora tienes un informe médico por si cambias de opinión. Espero que no lo hagas demasiado tarde."
    mc "I'm not pushing, Kiara. At least now you have a medical report in case you change your mind. I hope you don't do it too late."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1075
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_c023c137:

    # sca "Creo que te equivocas, [mc]. Si fuera yo, presentaría la denuncia, pero Kiara tiene razón."
    sca "I think you're wrong, [mc]. If it were me, I'd file the criminal report, but Kiara has a point."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1076
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_3c49f85a:

    # sca "Pero quien pega a una mujer por norma es un cobarde. Kiara y Eileen lo han abandonado, aunque sea temporalmente, y eso le hará recapacitar."
    sca "Whoever hits a woman is usually a coward. Kiara and Eileen have abandoned him, even if only temporarily, and that will bring him to his senses."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1077
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_def014f3:

    # mc "Espero que tengas razón. Que la tengáis las dos."
    mc "I hope you're right. Maybe you both are."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1079
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_f1d8bdfe:

    # kia "Yo sé que la tenemos, y lo verás la semana que viene cuando volvamos a casa."
    kia "I know we are, and you'll see next week when we head back home."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1080
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_5e10232b:

    # kia "Ahora debería ir a trabajar si no quiero llegar tarde. Muchas gracias por todo, [mc]."
    kia "Now I should go to work if I don't want to be late. Thank you so much for everything, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1081
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_b94a64b5:

    # mc "¿Quieres que pase a buscarte cuando salgas del trabajo?"
    mc "Do you want me to pick you up when you get off work?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1083
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_60042da8:

    # kia "No hace falta, cogeré el autobús. Saldré tarde hoy."
    kia "No need, I'll take the bus. I'll be out late today."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1084
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_b3a301a0:

    # kia "Nos vemos en casa de [nor], Scarlett. Hasta luego, [mc]."
    kia "See you at [nor]'s house, Scarlett. See you later, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1085
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_933e9869:

    # mc "Hasta luego, Kiara."
    mc "See you later, Kiara."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1087
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_3218746c:

    # sca "Nos vemos en casa, Kiara."
    sca "See you at home, Kiara."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1088
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_3a775a62:

    # mcp "{i}(Enorme diferencia en la misma frase. Para Scarlett ya es su casa. Kiara lógicamente se siente como una invitada. No me importaría que se quedaran. Estarían más seguras.){/i}"
    mcp "{i}(Huge difference in the same sentence. For Scarlett it's already her home. Kiara logically feels like a guest. I wouldn't mind if they stayed. They'd be safer.){/i}"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1089
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_54150ef5:

    # mc "Siguiente parada, el aeropuerto para recoger a Saira"
    mc "Next stop, the airport to pick up Saira."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1091
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_b9d51006:

    # sca "¿Saira? ¿No se llamaba así tu novia de Portland? Bueno... novia... la chica con la que tenías una relación abierta..."
    sca "Saira? Wasn't that the name of your girlfriend in Portland? Well... girlfriend... the girl you had an open relationship with..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1092
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_06eb7682:

    # mc "Sí, estoy seguro de que es ella. Solo me falta confirmarlo."
    mc "Yes, I'm almost certain it's her. I just need to confirm it."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1094
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_cb35737c:

    # sca "¿Querrías que fuera ella?"
    sca "Would you want it to be her?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1095
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_a84177cf:

    # mc "Por una parte no estoy seguro. Por otra, sí, lo querría. Si no fuera ella no la reconocería y me he dejado el cartel con su nombre en casa. *Risa*"
    mc "On the one hand I'm not sure. On the other, yes, I would want it. If it wasn't her I wouldn't recognize her and I've left the sign with her name on it at home. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1097
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_7e338ccc:

    # mc "¿Te molestaría que fuera ella?"
    mc "Would you mind if it is her?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1099
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_abb3b810:

    # sca "Por una parte sí. No saber si viene a recuperarte o no... me pondría nerviosa."
    sca "On the one hand yes. Not knowing if she's coming to get you back or not... it would make me nervous."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1100
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_1b73f7b4:

    # sca "Por otra parte, le debo estar agradecida."
    sca "On the other hand, I should be grateful to her."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1101
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_ce705018:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Por qué?"
    mc "What? Why?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1104
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_82bd8710:

    # sca "Por meterte en esa cabezota tuya la idea de las relaciones abiertas o con más de una chica."
    sca "For getting into that thick head of yours the idea of open relationships or relationships with more than one girl."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1106
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_17f694d7:

    # sca "No me gustaría tener que competir con [dap] por la exclusividad."
    sca "I wouldn't want to have to compete with [dap] for the exclusivity."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1108
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_75d06d6d:

    # sca "Si solo quisieras estar con una chica yo tendría menos oportunidades de ser la elegida."
    sca "If you only wanted to be with one girl I'd have a smaller chance of being the chosen one."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1110
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_69fa4c89:

    # sca "Por dejarte marchar sin asegurar la relación. Si no fuera por eso, difícilmente estaríamos juntos ahora."
    sca "For letting you leave without securing the relationship. If it wasn't for that, we'd hardly be together now."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1111
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_deb508bd:

    # mc "Tienes razón. La situación sería muy diferente si no fuera por ella."
    mc "You're right. The whole picture would be very different if it weren't for her."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1112
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_425e57ba:

    # mc "Ya que estamos hablando de Saira, ¿cómo quieres que te presente? ¿Amiga? ¿Novia?"
    mc "Since we're talking about Saira, how would you like me to introduce you? A friend? My girlfriend?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1114
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_739cb058:

    # sca "¡Novia, por supuesto! Si quieres hacerlo público claro..."
    sca "Girlfriend, of course! That is, if you want to make it public..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1115
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_c38fe74d:

    # mc "Entonces será novia."
    mc "Then girlfriend it is."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1117
translate english c13s004_KiaraAndScarlett_b5aa0bb2:

    # sca "¿Vamos? Tengo ganas de conocerla."
    sca "Shall we? I'm looking forward to meeting her."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1122
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_581ae97d:

    # mc "Vamos a quedarnos sentados aquí un momento, Scarlett. Hay un tema que quiero hablar contigo."
    mc "Let's just sit here for a while longer, Scarlett. There's something I want to talk to you about."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1123
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_5cc848a0:

    # sca "De golpe estás sonando muy serio, [mc]. ¿Pasa algo?"
    sca "All of a sudden you're sounding very serious, [mc]. Is something wrong?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1124
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_c84d738d:

    # mc "Bueno, hay algo que quiero comentarte."
    mc "Well, there's something I want to talk to you about."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1126
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_1729258b:

    # sca "Me estás preocupando. ¿He hecho algo malo?"
    sca "You're worrying me. Did I do something wrong?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1127
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_354b54b1:

    # mc "¿Tú? ¡No! Quiero hacerte unas preguntas sobre el tema de tu padre."
    mc "You? No! I want to ask you a few questions about your father's issue."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1129
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_b56d3f60:

    # sca "Bueno, después de lo que me ha dicho mi madre esta mañana, dudo que nunca le saque la verdad sobre quién es."
    sca "Well, after what my mother told me this morning, I doubt I'll ever get the truth out of her about who he is."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1130
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_8dd63e25:

    # sca "¿Puedes creerte que ha estado en contacto con él todo este tiempo? ¿Recibiendo dinero de él? ¿Y ocultándomelo?"
    sca "Can you believe she's been in contact with him all this time? Receiving money from him? And hiding it from me?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1131
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_bd5ea149:

    # mc "Tu madre me ha parecido un poco... no quiero ser ofensivo ni molestarte, al fin y al cabo es tu madre."
    mc "Your mother struck me as a bit... I don't mean to be offensive or upset you, after all she is your mother..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1133
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_a383464e:

    # sca "Puedes decir lo que quieras. No me voy a ofender aunque la llames despreciable. Ahora mismo es la palabra que me viene a la mente. Estoy muy enfadada con ella."
    sca "You can say whatever you want. I'm not going to be offended even if you call her despicable. Right now that's the word that comes to my mind. I'm very angry at her."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1134
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_5e488d70:

    # mc "Me ha parecido muy fuerte que dijera que le habías destrozado la vida, y que lo siguiente de lo que hablara fuera del dinero de tu padre..."
    mc "I thought it was very harsh of her to say that you had wrecked her life, and the next thing she was talking about was your father's money..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1136
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_725ec96e:

    # sca "Aunque no tiene disculpa, casi la entiendo. Para ella el dinero es muy importante. Mis abuelos no quisieron ayudarla cuando se quedó embarazada de mí."
    sca "Although she has no excuse, I almost understand her. Money is very important to her. My grandparents didn't want to help her when she got pregnant with me."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1137
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_edc402e2:

    # sca "Pasó de estar a punto de ir a Yale con una beca a tener que irse de casa y buscarse la vida trabajando de camarera en un bar cutre, viviendo de las propinas..."
    sca "She went from being about to go to Yale on a scholarship to having to leave home and make a living working as a waitress in a crappy bar, living off on tips..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1138
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_9836f015:

    # sca "Mis abuelos cambiaron de opinión cuando nací, pero ella no quiso volver. La relación ya estaba muy dañada entre ellos. Solo veía a mis abuelos en los cumpleaños, Acción de Gracias, Navidad..."
    sca "My grandparents changed their mind when I was born, but she didn't want to return back to their home. The relationship was already very damaged between them. I only saw my grandparents on birthdays, Thanksgiving, Christmas..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1139
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_829877c6:

    # mc "Pero parece que no vivía solo de las propinas, sino también del dinero que tu padre le enviaba."
    mc "But it seems that she didn't live only on tips, but also on the money your father sent her."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1141
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_e0feaea1:

    # sca "Sí, eso parece. Una mentira más que sumar a la larga lista de mentiras que ha contado sobre él. Si al menos supiera quién es..."
    sca "Yes, it looks like it. One more lie to add to the long list of lies she told me about him. If only I knew who he is..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1142
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_b524c179:

    # mc "Me parece que ha dicho alguna mentira más sobre el tema, como que ha dejado de mandar dinero por que ya tenías 18."
    mc "It looks like she told some more lies about it to you, like that he stopped sending money because you were already 18."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1144
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_6be23cd0:

    # sca "¿Por qué dices eso?"
    sca "Why do you say that?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1145
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_8ab0fcb9:

    # mc "Si te dijera que es posible que tenga una pista, que podrías encontrar a tu otra familia... ¿querrías seguirla?"
    mc "If I told you that I might have a lead, that you could find your other family.... would you want to follow it?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1147
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_8060518a:

    # sca "{b}¿Qué?{/b} ¡Por supuesto que querría!"
    sca "{b}What?{/b} Of course I would want to!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1148
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_07bd5463:

    # sca "¿De dónde has sacado la información?"
    sca "Where did you get the information?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1149
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_b5ca3c26:

    # mc "Antes de responderte, déjame darte algunos datos. No es tan sencillo."
    mc "Before I answer you, let me give you some facts. It's not that simple."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1151
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_51d8a628:

    # sca "¿Que puede haber de complicado? Una prueba de ADN resolvería las dudas..."
    sca "What could be so complicated? A DNA test would solve the doubts..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1152
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_bbde9e61:

    # mc "Lo complicado es que tu posible padre no está disponible para hacer una prueba de ADN. Pero déjame explicarte lo que sé."
    mc "The complicated thing is that your potential father is not available to do a DNA test. But let me explain what I know."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1154
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_d376aa84:

    # "Explicas a Scarlett la conversación de ayer con tu padre, sin decirle que es tu padre, y las pistas que dejó caer sobre la identidad de tu medio hermana."
    "You explain to Scarlett yesterday's conversation with your father, without telling her that he is your father, and the clues he dropped about the identity of your half-sister."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1155
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_e1e23ff8:

    # mc "Y eso es todo lo que sé."
    mc "And that's what I know."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1156
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_1b7cc215:

    # sca "Tengo que ser yo. 18 años, segunda de mi clase, empiezo medicina en la NWU, la matrícula está pagada, y ha enviado dinero a mi madre."
    sca "It has to be me. 18 years old, second in my class, starting medicine at NWU, tuition is paid for, and he has been sending money to my mother."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1157
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_7c813b7c:

    # mc "Ese último dato es el que me ha hecho atar cabos. Estaba bastante seguro de que podías ser tú, pero al decir tu madre lo del dinero casi ha confirmado mis sospechas."
    mc "That last bit of information is the one that tied things up for me. I was pretty sure it could be you, but your mother talking about the money almost confirmed my suspicions."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1159
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_99b10dd5:

    # sca "Pero hay una cosa que no entiendo. ¿Por qué ese hombre, mi posible padre, te lo contó a ti?"
    sca "But there's one thing I don't understand - why did that man, my possible father, tell you?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1161
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_081cc96b:

    # sca "A menos que..."
    sca "Unless..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1164
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_5a3e2bb4:

    # sca "No puede ser, ¿verdad? No eres mi medio hermano... no ahora..."
    sca "It can't be, can it? You're not my half-brother... not now..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1166
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_fa962ca9:

    # sca "No puede ser, ¿verdad? No eres mi medio hermano..."
    sca "It can't be, can it? You're not my half-brother..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1167
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_7caf724b:

    # mc "Podría ser. Engañó a mi madre y las fechas coinciden, pero deberíamos confirmarlo antes de..."
    mc "I could be. He cheated on my mother and the dates match, but we should confirm it before..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1169
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_d697b07d:

    # sca "¡Eres mi hermano!"
    sca "You are my brother!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1170
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_83726347:

    # mc "Scarlett, no. No lo sabemos todavía. Podría ser una chica de Westport que estudie medicina en la NWU. Tenemos que confirmarlo antes..."
    mc "Scarlett, no. We don't know yet. She could be a Westport girl studying medicine at NWU. We need to confirm it first..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1172
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_923be1b9:

    # sca "Tienes razón. Siempre pensé que quería encontrar a mi padre. Mi madre me dijo que estaba casado, pero ha mentido tanto que nunca pensé en si tendría hermanos."
    sca "You're right. I always thought I wanted to find my father. My mother told me he was married, but she has lied so much that I never thought about whether I would have siblings."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1173
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_376156d1:

    # mc "O primas... si mis sospechas son ciertas puede que tengas una gran familia."
    mc "Or cousins... if my assumptions are true you might have a big family."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1176
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_fce75663:

    # sca "Y esto... ¿cómo nos deja a nosotros?"
    sca "And this... How does that leave us?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1177
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_c8070494:

    # mc "Hasta que no tengamos confirmación, igual que estamos. No quiero actuar en base a suposiciones."
    mc "Until we have confirmation, same as we are. I don't want to act on assumptions."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1179
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_17ac4da4:

    # sca "Pero... ¿Y si somos...?"
    sca "But... What if we are...?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1180
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_0a02d0f5:

    # mc "¿Y si no somos...?"
    mc "What if we are not...?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1181
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_98e2c246:

    # mc "Acabamos de empezar a salir. No pienso romper contigo porque tengamos sospechas de que eres mi hermana."
    mc "We just started dating. I don't plan on breaking up with you because we have suspicions that you can be my half-sister."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1183
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_c2d875b1:

    # mc "Y aunque lo seas, tampoco pienso hacerlo."
    mc "And even if you are, I don't plan to do it either."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1185
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_435afb91:

    # mc "Y si lo eres, ya hablaremos de ello."
    mc "And if you are, we'll talk about it."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1188
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_bb4b8800:

    # sca "Suponía que esas cosas no te importaban... también sales con [dap]."
    sca "I assumed those things didn't matter to you... you are also dating [dap]."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1189
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_fc6ab40b:

    # mc "Bueno, sobre eso es algo que deberemos hablar [dap] y yo. A ella parece no importarle y..."
    mc "Well, that's something that [dap] and I will have to talk about. She doesn't seem to mind and..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1191
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_bd91776e:

    # sca "A mí tampoco me importaría..."
    sca "I wouldn't mind either..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1194
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_d264df90:

    # sca "A mí no me importaría..."
    sca "I wouldn't mind..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1195
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_cf7e0ea3:

    # mc "Entonces ya lo hablaremos si tenemos confirmación positiva. Y si es negativa, no habrá nada de lo que hablar. Primero habrá que confirmar si somos familia."
    mc "Then we'll talk about it if we have positive confirmation. And if it is negative, there will be nothing to talk about. First we will have to confirm if we are family."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1198
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_72180089:

    # sca "¿Te imaginas que [dap] y yo fueramos primas? Ya casi es como una hermana para mí y..."
    sca "Can you imagine if [dap] and I were cousins? She's almost like a sister to me already and..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1200
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_8077d522:

    # sca "¡[emm] sería mi hermana también!"
    sca "[emm] would be my sister too!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1201
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_b39954e4:

    # mc "Supongo que debes estar en shock ahora mismo. *Risa* No es típico de ti tardar tanto en darte cuenta de algo."
    mc "I guess you must be in shock right now. *Laugh* It's not like you to take this long to realize something."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1203
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_46981cf6:

    # sca "Son muchas cosas que asimilar..."
    sca "It's a lot of things to take in..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1204
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_a8a85577:

    # mc "Es normal, Scarlett. Ayer yo estaba igual que tú ahora mismo."
    mc "It's normal, Scarlett. Yesterday I was the same as you are right now."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1205
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_ebdb400b:

    # mc "Escucha, creo que deberías tomarte un tiempo para pensar. El vuelo de Saira llega en un rato y deberíamos ir al aeropuerto."
    mc "Listen, I think you should take some time to think. Saira's flight arrives in a little while and we should go to the airport."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1207
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_6ac64992:

    # sca "Entonces vamos a por ella. Creo que tenemos que hablar de esto sin interrupciones cuando haya tenido tiempo de asimilarlo y..."
    sca "Then let's go get her. I think we need to talk about this without interruption when I've had time to digest it and..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1208
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_dee69572:

    # mc "Solo una cosa más, Scarlett. De momento no se lo digas a nadie. Nadie sabe que he estado hablando con mi padre ni lo que me ha dicho. Me gustaría explicarlo cuando sea el momento."
    mc "Just one more thing, Scarlett. Don't tell anyone for the moment. No one knows that I have been talking to my father or what he has told me. I'd like to explain it when the time is right."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1209
translate english c13s004_GetSaira_b581a03d:

    # sca "Lo entiendo, aunque me moriré de ganas de decírselo a [dap]."
    sca "I understand, though I'll be dying to tell [dap]."

