    mc "No, Eileen is working right now, but she's looking forward to meeting you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1318
translate english qKissSairaArrival_7c1a38a3:

    # mc "¿Tienes que recoger maletas, Saira?"
    mc "Do you have to pick up any suitcase, Saira?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1320
translate english qKissSairaArrival_737749c5:

    # sai "No, va todo en el camión con los muebles y el resto de cosas. Debería haber llegado durante la mañana, salió ayer de Portland."
    sai "No, it's all coming on the truck with the furniture and the rest of the stuff. It should have arrived during the morning; it left Portland yesterday."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1321
translate english qKissSairaArrival_514fa989:

    # mc "Entonces vamos a casa, he salido pronto y no sé si ha llegado."
    mc "Then let's go home, I left early and I don't know if it's arrived."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1322
translate english qKissSairaArrival_b5707087:

    # mc "Además, tengo que descargar las cosas de Scarlett antes de ir a ver a la enfermera."
    mc "I also have to unload Scarlett's stuff before I go see the nurse."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1324
translate english qKissSairaArrival_ada8f6b1:

    # sca "¿La que ha atendido a Kiara?"
    sca "The one who attended to Kiara?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1325
translate english qKissSairaArrival_fc5b29c2:

    # mc "Sí, Samantha, la madre de Jamaal. Tengo que pasar a verla esta tarde. ¿Vamos?"
    mc "Yes, Samantha, Jamaal's mother. I need to stop by and see her this afternoon, shall we?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1330
translate english qKissSairaArrival_45b59a25:

    # "El camino a casa es incómodo, quizás no ha sido una buena idea besar a Saira delante de Scarlett y después presentarla como tu novia."
    "The ride home is awkward, maybe it wasn't a good idea to kiss Saira in front of Scarlett and then introduce her as your girlfriend."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1333
translate english qKissSairaArrival_a70929f9:

    # "De camino a casa Scarlett está dicharachera mientras Saira está silenciosa, quizás esperaba algo más que un beso en la mejilla."
    "On the way home Scarlett is chatty while Saira is silent, perhaps she was expecting more than a kiss on the cheek."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1337
translate english qKissSairaArrival_fc03d1b9:

    # "De camino a casa, Scarlett y Saira charlan animadamente. Besar a Saira ha hecho que sus dudas sobre vuestra relación se disipen."
    "On the way home, Scarlett and Saira chat animatedly. Kissing Saira has caused her doubts about your relationship to dissipate."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1340
translate english qKissSairaArrival_a70929f9_1:

    # "De camino a casa Scarlett está dicharachera mientras Saira está silenciosa, quizás esperaba algo más que un beso en la mejilla."
    "On the way home Scarlett is chatty while Saira is silent, perhaps she was hoping for more than a kiss on the cheek."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1345
translate english qKissSairaArrival_7ef27bcd:

    # "El camino a casa es incómodo, quizás no ha sido una buena idea besar a Saira delante de Scarlett y después presentarla como tu novia. Y para colmo decirles que también estás con Eileen."
    "The ride home is awkward, maybe it wasn't a good idea to kiss Saira in front of Scarlett and then introduce her as your girlfriend. And to top it off tell them you're also with Eileen."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1348
translate english qKissSairaArrival_05f49f85:

    # "El camino a casa es incómodo, quizás no ha sido una buena idea decirles que estás con Eileen. Y seguramente Saira esperaba más que un beso en la mejilla."
    "The ride home is awkward, maybe it wasn't a good idea to tell them you're with Eileen. And surely Saira was expecting more than a kiss on the cheek."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1352
translate english qKissSairaArrival_c3203a91:

    # "De camino a casa Scarlett está dicharachera mientras Saira parece enfadada, quizás decirle que estás con Eileen justo después de besarla no ha sido buena idea."
    "On the way home Scarlett is chatty while Saira looks angry, maybe telling her you're with Eileen right after kissing her wasn't such a good idea."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1355
translate english qKissSairaArrival_a70929f9_2:

    # "De camino a casa Scarlett está dicharachera mientras Saira está silenciosa, quizás esperaba algo más que un beso en la mejilla."
    "On the way home Scarlett is chatty while Saira is silent, perhaps she was expecting more than a kiss on the cheek."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1356
translate english qKissSairaArrival_d7933132:

    # "Llegas a casa y entras a presentar a Saira. Scarlett se queda fuera mientras empieza a bajar cajas y maletas."
    "You get home and go inside to introduce Saira. Scarlett stays outside and starts unloading boxes and suitcases."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1359
translate english qKissSairaArrival_0bb86a38:

    # mc "Saira, esta es [mar], mi madre. Es una de las administradoras del dormitorio."
    mc "Saira, this is [mar], my mother. She's one of the dorm administrators."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1361
translate english qKissSairaArrival_4b10f43e:

    # mc "Saira, esta es [mar], ya te he hablado de ella. Es una de las administradoras del dormitorio."
    mc "Saira, this is [mar], I've already told you about her. She's one of the dorm administrators."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1362
translate english qKissSairaArrival_e0704aeb:

    # mom "Encantada de conocerte, Saira. [mc] nos ha hablado de ti."
    mom "Nice to meet you, Saira. [mc] has told us about you."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1367
translate english qKissSairaArrival_67cd24c1:

    # mc "Y esta es [emm], mi hermana. Seguro que os vais a llevar bien."
    mc "And this is [emm], my sister. I'm sure you two are going to get along fine."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1368
translate english qKissSairaArrival_517372d7:

    # emm "Seguro. Bienvenida a casa, Saira."
    emm "Sure. Welcome home, Saira."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1370
translate english qKissSairaArrival_16706699:

    # sai "Encantada de conoceros a las dos. [mc] también me habló mucho de vosotras durante el tiempo que estuvimos juntos en Portland."
    sai "Nice to meet you both. [mc] also told me a lot about you during our time together in Portland."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1372
translate english qKissSairaArrival_31109ebc:

    # mom "Voy a acompañarte a tu habitación. Hace 20 minutos que se han ido los de las mudanzas que han traído tus cosas."
    mom "I'm going to walk you to your room. It's been 20 minutes since the movers who brought your stuff left."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1373
translate english qKissSairaArrival_9260c785:

    # mom "Así también te presento a dos de las chicas que viven en tu misma planta. Las otras dos están en clase."
    mom "I'll also introduce you to two of the girls who live on the same floor as you. The other two are currently at the university."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1375
translate english qKissSairaArrival_c3facc94:

    # sai "Gracias, [mar]."
    sai "Thank you, [mar]."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1376
translate english qKissSairaArrival_04f9ebfb:

    # mc "Yo voy a salir a llevar las cosas de Scarlett a la habitación de [dap]."
    mc "I'm going out to help carry Scarlett's things to [dap]'s room."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1378
translate english qKissSairaArrival_97d40d01:

    # mom "¿Cómo está? [nor] me ha explicado lo que ha pasado."
    mom "How is she? [nor] explained to me what happened."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1379
translate english qKissSairaArrival_95d352f7:

    # mc "Ahora está mejor, pero ha sido duro para ella."
    mc "She's better now, but it's been hard for her."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1380
translate english qKissSairaArrival_d207d47c:

    # mom "Cuando acabe de enseñarle la casa a Saira iré a verla. Creo que va a necesitar el cariño de todas."
    mom "When I finish showing Saira around the house I'm going to go see her. I think she's going to need everyone's love."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1382
translate english qKissSairaArrival_f7e4136f:

    # mcp "(Antes de hacer nada con las pruebas de ADN, debería hablar con [mar.mc!t] y explicarle lo que sé.)"
    mcp "(Before we do any DNA testing, I should talk to [mar.mc!t] and explain what I know.)"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1384
translate english qKissSairaArrival_14bc4659:

    # emm "Yo te acompaño, [mc]. Tengo ganas de darle un abrazo, y así os ayudo a subir cosas."
    emm "I'll go with you, [mc]. I feel like giving her a hug, and I can help you guys get stuff upstairs."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1385
translate english qKissSairaArrival_fea41c93:

    # mc "Perfecto, vamos. Ahora mismo está descargando ella sola la camioneta."
    mc "Perfect, let's go. She's unloading the truck by herself right now."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1386
translate english qKissSairaArrival_7502ee8c:

    # mc "Saira, te veo luego, cuando estés instalada. [mar.mc!t], cuando acabes, estamos en casa de [nor]."
    mc "Saira, I'll see you later, when you're settled. [mar.mc!t], when you're done, we're at [nor]'s house."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1388
translate english qKissSairaArrival_1d9d3b55:

    # "Sales a la calle y te encuentras una tierna imagen con [nor] abrazando a Scarlett, mientras [dap] se dirige casi volando hacia ellas."
    "You go out into the garden and find a tender image with [nor] hugging Scarlett, while [dap] is almost flying towards them."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1390
translate english qKissSairaArrival_9ce8349b:

    # dap "Vas a estar bien aquí, Scarlett. Será como cuando vienes a pasar una noche, pero será para siempre."
    dap "You're going to be fine here, Scarlett. It'll be just like when you come for one night, but it'll be forever."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1392
translate english qKissSairaArrival_4b60ca71:

    # nor "Solo tienes que pedir lo que necesites. Considéranos tu nueva familia."
    nor "Just ask for whatever you need. Consider us your new family."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1394
translate english qKissSairaArrival_d9310a72:

    # mcp "(No sabes lo cerca que podrías estar de la verdad, [nor].)"
    mcp "(You don't know how close you might be to the truth, [nor].)"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1396
translate english qKissSairaArrival_00cbb795:

    # eri "Si te vuelves a teñir de pelirroja y yo vuelvo a mi color, podremos pasar por tres hermanas. O puedes volver tú a tu color y que [dap] se tiña de morena."
    eri "If you dye your hair red again and I go back to my color, we can pass for three sisters. Or you can go back to your color and have [dap] dye hers black."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1398
translate english qKissSairaArrival_8277e542:

    # dap "¡Ni en broma!" (multiple=2)
    dap "No way!" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1399
translate english qKissSairaArrival_de78fd2a:

    # sca "¡Ni por todo el oro del mundo!" (multiple=2)
    sca "Not for all the gold in the world!" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1400
translate english qKissSairaArrival_6e02fda0:

    # mc "*Risa* Parece que el color del pelo no se toca. Seréis una rubia, una pelirroja y una morena."
    mc "*Laugh* Looks like hair color is a sensible topic. You'll be a blonde, a redhead, and a brunette."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1402
translate english qKissSairaArrival_94718762:

    # emm "¿Puedo abrazar a mi nueva prima?"
    emm "Can I hug my new cousin?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1404
translate english qKissSairaArrival_c28f33d0:

    # mcp "(O incluso a tu nueva medio hermana, si mis sospechas son correctas.)"
    mcp "(Or even your new half-sister, if my suspicions are correct.)"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1406
translate english qKissSairaArrival_db68648a:

    # mcp "(O incluso a mi medio hermana, si mis sospechas son correctas.)"
    mcp "(Or even my half-sister, if my suspicions are correct.)"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1408
translate english qKissSairaArrival_6ecadac4:

    # sca "Al final me vais a hacer llorar. No esperaba esta recepción..."
    sca "You're going to make me cry in the end. I didn't expect this reception..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1409
translate english qKissSairaArrival_1180c57e:

    # emm "*Susurrando* Si quieres hacerlo, no te cortes, estás en familia."
    emm "*Whispering* If you want to do it, don't hold back, you're among family."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1411
translate english qKissSairaArrival_de3d4712:

    # nor "Scarlett, llevas años viniendo a nuestra casa. Ahora también es la tuya."
    nor "Scarlett, you've been coming to our house for years. Now it's yours too."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1412
translate english qKissSairaArrival_a9271edf:

    # mc "Ahora que ha acabado la ronda de abrazos. ¿Subimos las cosas de Scarlett entre todos?"
    mc "Now that the round of hugs is over, shall we all take Scarlett's stuff upstairs together?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1414
translate english qKissSairaArrival_9890eac7:

    # todas "¡Vamos!"
    todas "Let's go!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1416
translate english qKissSairaArrival_71763a6c:

    # "Entre todos subís las cosas de Scarlett en pocos viajes. Meemaw y Betty han ido al centro y no están en casa para ayudar."
    "Together you all bring up Scarlett's stuff in just a few trips. Meemaw and Betty have gone downtown and aren't home to help."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1417
translate english qKissSairaArrival_629e73f5:

    # "Kate y Debbie se unen a la mudanza en cuanto [mar] les dice las novedades al presentarles a Saira. Poco después también se unen [mar] y Saira."
    "Kate and Debbie join and help in moving as soon as [mar] tells them the news when she introduces them to Saira. Shortly thereafter [mar] and Saira also join."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1418
translate english qKissSairaArrival_4bdf5fa1:

    # "Hacéis el trabajo como si de una verdadera familia se tratara. Quizás algún día..."
    "You do the job like a real family. Maybe someday..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1422
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_20102cea:

    # "Después de subir las cosas de Scarlett a la habitacón de [dap] te despides de todo el mundo y vas a casa de Samantha."
    "After you take Scarlett's things up to [dap]'s room you say goodbye to everyone and go to Samantha's house."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1423
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_8479baca:

    # "Tienes que compensar el plantón de ayer y quieres pasar el máximo de rato con ella y Jamaal."
    "You have to make up for yesterday's standup and you want to spend as much time with her and Jamaal as possible."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1425
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_1896a1ee:

    # "Bueno, con Jamaal no tanto como con ella."
    "Well, with Jamaal not as much as with her."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1427
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_6092ea65:

    # "*Ding-Dong*"
    "*Ding-Dong*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1428
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_c1b60df2:

    # jam "*Gritando a través de la puerta* Ya voy yo, Mamá."
    jam "*Shouting through the door* I got it, Mom."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1430
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_55b9b40a:

    # jam "¡Hermano! Me ha dicho mi madre que ibas a venir. Esperaba que no nos dieras plantón como ayer."
    jam "Brother! My mother told me you were coming. I was hoping you wouldn't stand us up like yesterday."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1431
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_ff39ab6d:

    # mc "Lo siento, Jam. Surgió algo importante."
    mc "I'm sorry, Jam. Something important came up."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1433
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_7ea85a57:

    # jam "*Gritando* Me dolió mucho en el corazón que nos abandonaras por esa cosa que tenías que hacer."
    jam "*Shouting* It hurt my heart so much that you ditched us for that thing you had to do."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1434
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_f1c09c2f:

    # jam "*Gritando* Tuve que hacer un esfuerzo y comer más pastitas de las que debía..."
    jam "*Shouting* I had to make an effort and eat more pastries than I should have..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1436
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_4210a6dd:

    # jam "*Susurrando* Pero yo te agradecí que no vinieras. Me puse hasta el culo de pastitas."
    jam "*Whispering* But I thanked you for not coming. I ended up stuffing myself with pastries."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1437
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_669c29df:

    # mc "*Susurrando* Eres un capullo. *Risa*"
    mc "*Whispering* You're such a dick. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1438
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_dc036ff8:

    # mc "*Gritando* Si no me hubieras dicho que hacía tres días que no te duchabas, a lo mejor me hubiera atrevido a venir."
    mc "*Shouting* If you hadn't told me you hadn't showered for three days, maybe I would have dared to come."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1439
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_0359678e:

    # sam "*Desde la cocina* Sabéis que no susurraís demasiado flojo, ¿verdad?"
    sam "*From the kitchen* You guys know you don't whisper too softly, right?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1441
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_d8b54348:

    # jam "Tío, no sabes ni susurrar. Anda, pasa."
    jam "Man, you can't even whisper. Come on in."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1442
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_c0d6cb94:

    # mc "Apártate primero de en medio. No pienso saltar por encima tuyo. Ya sabes que las carreras de vallas no se me daban bien."
    mc "Get out of the way first. I'm not going to jump over you. You know I'm not good at hurdle races."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1444
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_8869c9cb:

    # sam "Al final has podido venir."
    sam "You finally made it."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1445
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_5546a9fe:

    # mc "No podía darte plantón dos días seguidos."
    mc "I couldn't stand you up two days in a row."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1446
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_8fcb857c:

    # mc "Por Jamaal no me importa, pero a ti no osaría dejarte plantada por segunda vez."
    mc "I wouldn't care for Jamaal, but I wouldn't dare stand you up for a second time."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1448
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_3a623aad:

    # jam "Claro, como el pobre Jamaal ya está plantado en su silla... ¿qué más da dejarlo plantado también cuando se queda con él?"
    jam "Of course, since poor Jamaal can't stand up for himself... what's the harm in standing him up too when you've committed to visiting him?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1449
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_be72dc6b:

    # mc "Calla y déjame saludar a tu madre como es debido."
    mc "Shut up and let me greet your mother properly."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1451
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_178e8182:

    # mc "Estás guapísima, como siempre."
    mc "You look beautiful, as always."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1452
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_703e5917:

    # sam "Y tú eres un adulador, como siempre. Pero puedes seguir haciéndolo, me encanta."
    sam "And you're a flatterer, as usual. But you can keep doing it, I love it."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1454
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_6c28c601:

    # sam "Podéis ir a hacer lo que queráis, lo tendré todo preparado en unos minutos."
    sam "You guys can go do whatever you want, I'll have it all set up in a few minutes."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1455
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_6d700f97:

    # mc "¿Necesitas ayuda?"
    mc "Do you need help?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1456
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_31dc2b07:

    # sam "No, qué va. Solo me estorbaríais en la cocina."
    sam "No, no way. You'd just be in my way in the kitchen."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1457
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_55f98a7e:

    # mc "Te esperamos aquí sentados. Bueno, Jamaal siempre espera sentado. Es un vago."
    mc "We'll wait for you sitting on the couch. Well, Jamaal always waits sitting down. He's a bit lazy."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1459
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_4565074d:

    # sam "¡[mc]! Ya sabes que no me gusta que hagas esas bromas."
    sam "[mc]! You know I don't like you making those jokes."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1460
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_caee36db:

    # mc "Perdón, Sam. Es la costumbre."
    mc "Sorry, Sam. It's just the habit..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1462
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_c504b1d6:

    # jam "¡Hey, a mí me gustan esas bromas! Para una vez que usa el cerebro, déjalo antes de que lo confundan con una endivia."
    jam "Hey, I like those jokes! For once he uses his brain, let him do it before he gets mistaken for a lettuce."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1463
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_fd06acd4:

    # mc "Tú te callas, si Sam no quiere que haga esas bromas, te las haré en privado. Y no, no es una proposición."
    mc "You shut up, if Sam doesn't want me to make those jokes, I'll make them to you in private. And no, it's not a proposition."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1465
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_896219b0:

    # jam "Tampoco eres mi tipo. *Risa* Y no me puedo desgravar de los impuestos hacer obras de caridad de ese tipo."
    jam "You're not my type either. *Laugh* And I can't get a tax break doing charity work like teaching you what a real man is like."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1466
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_393f2823:

    # jam "Estaremos en mi habitación, Mamá. Avísanos cuando esté todo listo."
    jam "We'll be in my room, Mom. Let us know when everything is ready."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1468
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_b9951adf:

    # jam "¿Te llegó mi correo? ¿Recordabas las contraseñas?"
    jam "Did you get my email? Did you remember the passwords?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1469
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_e485850f:

    # mc "Sí, son contraseñas que no olvidaré nunca. *Risa*"
    mc "Yes, those are passwords I'll never forget. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1470
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_ff23f4ff:

    # mc "Gracias por la información, pero recuerda esas dos preguntas estúpidas que acabas de hacer."
    mc "Thanks for the information, but remember those two stupid questions you just asked."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1472
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_e0776d40:

    # jam "¿Estúpidas? ¿Por qué?"
    jam "Stupid? Why?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1473
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_c3a39331:

    # mc "Luego te lo explico. ¿Has conseguido encontrar los nombres de las cinco chicas que te pedí?"
    mc "I'll explain it later. Did you manage to find the names of the five girls I asked for?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1475
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_4a874792:

    # jam "Sí, es gracioso. Amanda, Beatrice, aunque a veces aparece como Beatrix, Claire, Diana, y Eva. ABCDE. Todas se apellidan Gilford. GILF-ord."
    jam "Yes, it's funny. Amanda, Beatrice, although she sometimes appears as Beatrix, Claire, Diana, and Eva. ABCDE. They all have the last name Gilford. GILF-ord."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1476
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_4b5e73b9:

    # mc "Gracias, Jam. ¿Ya has descubierto por qué tus preguntas son estúpidas?"
    mc "Thanks, Jam. Have you figured out why your questions are stupid yet?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1478
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_331f1ff9:

    # jam "No, sigo sin verlo."
    jam "No, I still don't see it."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1479
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_6f754df5:

    # mc "Has buscado el nombre de cinco chicas que te pedí ayer, ¿verdad?"
    mc "You searched for the names of the five girls I asked for yesterday, didn't you?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1480
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_7ddf4456:

    # jam "Sí, claro. Me puse a ello en el momento en que recibí tu correo..."
    jam "Yeah, right. I got on it the moment I got your email..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1482
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_9fb4b99a:

    # jam "Correo que no me hubieras enviado si no hubieras recibido el mío... vale, colega, tu hermano es tonto."
    jam "Email you wouldn't have sent me if you hadn't received mine... okay, dude, your brother's dumb."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1483
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_76dc6aa0:

    # mc "No, no lo eres."
    mc "No, you're not."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1484
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_1b28c348:

    # jam "Gracias..."
    jam "Thank you..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1485
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_4a4b70b4:

    # mc "Me refiero a que no eres mi hermano. Tu tontedad me avergüenza y te repudio. *Risa*"
    mc "I mean you are not my brother. Your dumbness shames me and I disown you. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1487
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_372a747b:

    # jam "¡Eres un capullo! ¿Dónde ibas a encontrar un hermano tan guapo como yo?"
    jam "You're such a dick! Where would you find a brother as handsome as me?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1488
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_95caa390:

    # mc "En el zoo seguramente. Si me tengo que retener toda la tarde de meterme contigo por lo que ha dicho Sam, tengo que quitarme el mono ahora."
    mc "In a Picasso painting surely. If I have to hold back all afternoon from messing with you because of what Sam said, I have to get the anxiety out of the way now."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1491
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_9dfba07e:

    # jam "¿Toda la tarde? ¡Ni lo pienses! No pienso estar con los dos tortolitos fastidiándoos el plan."
    jam "All afternoon? Don't even think about it! I'm not going to be with you two lovebirds screwing up your plan."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1492
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_ab44cd1a:

    # mc "Jam, no hay plan. He venido a veros como he venido toda mi vida. Recuerda que todas esas paranoias tuyas eran hipotéticas."
    mc "Jam, there is no plan. I've come to see you like I've been coming to see you all my life. Remember all that paranoia of yours was just hypothetical."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1494
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_435f8687:

    # jam "Sí, sí. Una de las razones por las que venías es porque siempre te gustó mi madre. La otra eran los pastelillos. Ahora tienes las dos cosas. *Risa*"
    jam "Yes, yes. One of the reasons you were coming was because you always liked my mother. The other was the pastries. Now you can have both. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1495
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_4f8b8e2f:

    # mc "Bueno, hoy me conformo con los pastelillos."
    mc "Well, I'll settle for pastries today."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1497
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_d62cfea5:

    # jam "¿Toda la tarde? ¿No te ha dicho mi madre que tenía que irme hoy?"
    jam "All afternoon? Didn't my mother tell you I had to leave today?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1498
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_61a919b2:

    # mc "No, no me lo ha dicho. Pero bueno, más pastelillos para mí."
    mc "No, she didn't tell me. But okay, more pastries for me."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1500
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_edb44e28:

    # jam "La próxima vez que me llames glotón, te recordaré esta conversación. *Risa*"
    jam "Next time you call me a glutton, I'll remind you of this conversation. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1502
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_54393d31:

    # jam "Cambiando de tema. ¿Hay algo que me puedas contar sobre la investigación? ¿O tengo que seguir investigando a ciegas?"
    jam "Changing the subject. Is there anything you can tell me about the research? Or do I have to keep researching it blindly?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1503
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_0528f3a0:

    # mc "Hoy me he encontrado con alguien. Me ha dicho que en uno o dos días me va a dar más información."
    mc "I ran into someone today. Told me that in the next day or two they are going to give me more information."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1505
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_dc20080f:

    # jam "¿Nada que puedas contarme ahora?"
    jam "Nothing you can tell me now?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1506
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_a850a26a:

    # mc "He aprendido más con tu correo de lo que sabía por mí mismo. Sabes lo mismo que yo."
    mc "I've learned more from your email than I discovered on my own. You know as much as I do."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1508
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_e5b1fd53:

    # jam "No. Yo sé mucho más ahora que ayer. He descubierto de dónde sacan el dinero."
    jam "No. I know a lot more now than I did yesterday. I've figured out where they get the money from."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1509
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_1479c7c8:

    # mc "¿De dónde?"
    mc "From where?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1511
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_15b20c9e:

    # jam "Vas a flipar. NTR se dedica a hacer Operaciones Especiales en las que nuestro gobierno no quiere involucrarse directamente."
    jam "You're going to freak out. NTR is in the business of doing Black Ops that our government doesn't want to get directly involved in."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1512
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_813b460f:

    # mc "¿Son mercenarios?"
    mc "Are they mercenaries?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1513
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_69cfab07:

    # jam "Más o menos. Pero unos mercenarios especiales. Utilizan niños para las misiones."
    jam "Sort of. But special mercenaries. They use children for their missions."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1514
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_a3db9a7f:

    # mc "¿Qué?"
    mc "What?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1516
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_10176a3c:

    # jam "Sí, yo también he flipado. Te pongo un ejemplo. He encontrado un par de expedientes de misiones en las que han participado clones de la Serie G. Casi todo censurado."
    jam "Yeah, I freaked out too. Here's an example. I've found a couple of mission dossiers involving Series G clones. Almost all censored."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1517
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_9338b2ba:

    # mcp "(La serie G son los que se colaron ayer en casa. Eric era Serie E y el resto Serie G.)"
    mcp "(The Series G are the ones that snuck into the house yesterday. Eric was Series E and the rest were Series G.)"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1518
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_b7d42ea5:

    # jam "Lo más curioso es que la Serie G se creó hace 13 años. ¡Son pre-adolescentes!"
    jam "The weirdest thing is that the Series G was created 13 years ago - they're pre-teens!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1519
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_5f4fce49:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¡Es imposible! Yo..."
    mc "What? It's impossible! I..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1520
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_7dd6db3e:

    # mcp "(Yo los he visto y diría que tienen alrededor de 20 años.)"
    mcp "(I've seen them and I'd say they were about 20 years old.)"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1522
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_b962afc7:

    # jam "Tú... ¿qué?"
    jam "You... what?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1523
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_2d01692a:

    # mc "Yo lo veo muy raro... ¿sabes cuando se creó la Serie E?"
    mc "This all seems very fishy.... Do you know when the Series E was created?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1524
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_f93cab63:

    # jam "E-F-G... Dos años antes. Hace unos 15. ¿Por qué?"
    jam "E-F-G... Two years earlier. About 15. Why?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1525
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_b7d1bd08:

    # mc "Creía haber conocido a un tipo de la Serie E, pero es imposible. Debía estar en la mitad de sus 30."
    mc "I thought I met a guy from Series E, but it's impossible. He looked like he was in his mid-30s."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1526
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_d8939e57:

    # mcp "(¿Hay otra empresa haciendo lo mismo que NTR pero con años de ventaja? Las fechas no cuadran con las edades que vi.)"
    mcp "(Is there another company doing the same thing as NTR but years ahead? The dates don't match the ages I saw.)"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1528
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_5153b1f4:

    # jam "¿Has conocido a un clon?"
    jam "Have you met a clone?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1530
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_bf226bd2:

    # mcp "(He estado hablando con una hace unas horas. Fliparías.)"
    mcp "(I've been talking to one a few hours ago. You'd freak out.)"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1532
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_1b1e0659:

    # mcp "(Sí, y tú también. Pero no puedo traicionar las identidades de [emm], [dap], y [eri]. Al menos no sin que ellas lo sepan.)"
    mcp "(Yes, and so do you. But I can't betray the identities of [emm], [dap], and [eri]. At least not without them knowing about it.)"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1533
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_677db572:

    # mc "Lo que he dicho es que me había parecido conocerlo, pero las edades no cuadran."
    mc "What I said is that I had thought I've met one, but the ages don't match up."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1535
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_84b59426:

    # jam "Aparte de eso tienen actividades médicas. Nada que esté aprobado en los Estados Unidos. Supongo que una cosa es que los usemos para operaciones encubiertas..."
    jam "Other than that they have medical activities. Nothing that is approved in the United States. I guess it's one thing for us to use them for covert operations..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1536
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_84aa2153:

    # mc "Y otra diferente que les dejemos vender medicamentos aquí..."
    mc "And a different one that our government let them sell medicines here..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1538
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_3674c85c:

    # jam "Oh, no, no son medicamentos. Son más bien articulos avanzados de farmacia. Maquinaria, tests para enfermedades..."
    jam "Oh, no, they're not medicines. They're more like advanced pharmacy items. Machinery, tests for diseases..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1539
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_cdb1991d:

    # sam "*Desde el salón* Ya está todo listo. Dejad los videojuegos antes de que se enfríe el té."
    sam "*From the living room* Everything is ready. Put down the video games before the tea gets cold."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1540
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_02d3bb09:

    # mc "Seguimos luego, y mándame todo lo que tengas por correo. No podemos hacer esperar a tu madre."
    mc "We'll continue later, and send me everything you have by email. We can't keep your mother waiting."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1542
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_1fff2716:

    # sam "Hacía días que no te veía, [mc], excepto esta mañana, claro."
    sam "It's been days since I've seen you, [mc], except for this morning, of course."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1543
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_b7b8dc8e:

    # sam "¿Alguna novedad en casa?"
    sam "Any news at home?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1544
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_4c23ed94:

    # mc "Bueno, hoy ha llegado la última de las estudiantes. Ya sabes que Eileen y Kiara están viviendo en casa también."
    mc "Well, the last of the students arrived today. You know Eileen and Kiara are living at home too."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1545
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_82523d1b:

    # mc "Y hoy se ha mudado Scarlett, la amiga de [dap]. Problemas en casa."
    mc "And [dap]'s friend, Scarlett, moved in today. Trouble at home."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1547
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_f115703e:

    # sam "Es decir, que estás viviendo con... 13 mujeres, ¿no? No me extraña que quieras fugarte y visitarnos. *Risa*"
    sam "I mean, you're living with... 13 women, right? No wonder you want to escape and visit us. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1548
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_779d4975:

    # mc "No es malo, de verdad. Y son 15. No has contado a mi Meemaw y a Tía Betty. Llegaron el sábado."
    mc "It's not that bad, really. And there are 15 of them. You didn't count my Meemaw and Aunt Betty. They arrived on Saturday."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1550
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_d80eb7d1:

    # jam "*Risa* No es malo ahora. Espera a que se les sincronicen los periodos a las 15... aunque tu abuela y Betty no serán un problema en eso, ¿verdad?"
    jam "*Laugh* It's not bad now. Wait till the 15 of them get their periods synched up... although your grandma and Betty won't be a problem on that one, will they?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1551
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_633e1d0c:

    # mc "*Risa* ¡Qué bruto eres!... ¿Me acogeriais una semana en casa si se diera el caso? *Risa*"
    mc "*Laugh* What a jerk you are... Would you take me in for a week if it came to that? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1553
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_f5f7d6ec:

    # sam "Si se diera el caso, con lo mal que lo pinta Jamaal, creo que tendrías que huir del país un par de semanas. A alguna isla del Caribe. *Risa*"
    sam "If it came to that, as bad as Jamaal portrays it, I think you'd have to flee the country for a couple of weeks. To some island in the Caribbean. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1554
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_019bb16a:

    # sam "Aunque él no tiene queja cuando se nos sincroniza a Simone y a mí... {b}Verdad{/b}, ¿hijo?"
    sam "Although he has no complaint when Simone and I are synced up.... {b}Right{/b}, son?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1556
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_2d949aaa:

    # jam "No hagas caso, [mc]. Cuando se les sincroniza me encierro en mi habitación una semana. Esa semana soy super productivo en el trabajo."
    jam "Pay no attention, [mc]. When they get synced, I lock myself in my room for a week. That week I'm super productive at work."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1557
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_0b268a67:

    # mc "Jamaal, no sabes donde te estás metiendo..."
    mc "Jamaal, you don't know what you're getting yourself into..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1559
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_5a821ce0:

    # sam "No pasa nada, ya lo conocemos y sabemos cómo son sus bromas. No nos afectan demasiado."
    sam "It's okay, we already know him and we know what his jokes are like. They don't affect us too much."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1560
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_3c29d55c:

    # mc "¿Y tú qué me cuentas, Sam? ¿Alguna novedad desde que fuimos a cenar?"
    mc "What about you, Sam? Any news since we went to dinner?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1562
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_64e9b365:

    # sam "Que llevo una vida aburrida. Trabajo y casa. Eso hace que los días parezcan todos iguales y se hagan eternos. Cuando miras atrás a una cosa especial, como nuestra cena, parece que fue ayer."
    sam "That I lead a boring life. Work and home. That makes the days all seem the same and go on forever. When you look back on a special thing, like our dinner, it seems like yesterday."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1563
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_ed8148ce:

    # mc "Pues habrá que repetirlo..."
    mc "Well, we'll have to do it again..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1565
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_9db7566c:

    # jam "Vosotros planead vuestra próxima cita, que a mí me está entrando hambre y esas pastitas me están llamando."
    jam "You guys plan your next date, I'm getting hungry and those pastries are calling me."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1567
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_0b73b421:

    # sam "Solo hay un problema... tu ya comiste ayer más de las que te tocaban. Estas son para [mc]."
    sam "There's just one problem... you already ate more than your share yesterday. These are for [mc]."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1568
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_5c1d1cc0:

    # jam "¡Mamaaaaa!"
    jam "Moooom!"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1570
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_a877c334:

    # sam "¿Qué quieres que te diga? Creo que me está empezando a bajar el periodo... *Risa*"
    sam "What do you want me to say? I think I'm starting to get my period... *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1571
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_cbc7b203:

    # mc "*Risa* Nunca te metas con el periodo de la mujer que te prepara la comida, Jam. Yo si que voy a comer alguna pastita, si no te importa, Sam."
    mc "*Laugh* Never mess with the woman who makes your food's period, Jam. I am going to taste some pastries, if you don't mind, Sam."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1573
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_48913338:

    # sam "Por supuesto que no, cariño. Tú puedes comer."
    sam "Of course not, honey. You can eat."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1574
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_277ec0bf:

    # mc "Mmmmm... que buenas están estas pastitas, Jamaal. Lástima que tú no puedas comer... están deliciosas..."
    mc "Mmmmm... these pastries are so good, Jamaal. Too bad you can't eat them... they're delicious..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1576
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_f1394835:

    # jam "Eres... eres... eres un capullo glotón."
    jam "You're... you're... you're a gluttonous jerk."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1577
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_b4141e1a:

    # mc "No te enfurruñes, Jam, tú te comiste las tuyas ayer. *Risa*"
    mc "Don't sulk, Jam, you ate yours yesterday. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1579
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_74b00986:

    # sam "No te preocupes, el enfurruñamiento le durará hasta que le diga que hoy voy a hacer empanadas argentinas para cenar. ¿Quieres quedarte a cenar?"
    sam "Don't worry, the sulking will last until I tell him I'm making Argentinian empanadas for dinner today. Do you want to stay for dinner?"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1580
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_e8ffb4ec:

    # mc "Me encantaría, pero con cuatro inquilinas nuevas... creo que debería estar en casa, por si [mar.mc!t] y [nor] me necesitan."
    mc "I'd love to, but with four new tenants...I think I should be home, in case [mar.mc!t] and [nor] need me."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1582
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_e36627c0:

    # jam "Sólo faltaría eso, que también te comieras las empanadas..."
    jam "I couldn't stand that, you eating my empanadas too..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1583
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_7ee9ae06:

    # jam "Sabes que puedes pedirme lo que quieras, pero con mi comida no puedes jugar..."
    jam "You know you can ask me for whatever you want, but you can't play with my food..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1584
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_9f3fc5f6:

    # mc "Seguro que tu madre haría más empanadas de las necesarias si me quedase yo, no es que fuese a quitarte comida del plato para ponérmela a mí. *Risa*"
    mc "I'm sure your mom would make more empanadas than needed if I stayed, it's not like she was going to take food off your plate to put it on mine. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1586
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_0fbdef56:

    # sam "No me des ideas, que se está poniendo un poco fondón... *Risa*"
    sam "Don't give me ideas, he's getting a little chubby.... *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1587
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_89b0a258:

    # mc "Echará de menos tener un gordo en la familia, y querrá coger él ese rol. *Risa*"
    mc "I'm sure he misses having a fat man in the family, and he wants to take on that role himself. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1589
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_62a1032a:

    # jam "¡No tengo por qué aguantar esto! Voy a irme a la calle a tomarme un café y un dónut antes de irme a ese sitio que tengo que ir..."
    jam "I don't have any need to endure this! I'm going to go outside and have a coffee and a doughnut before I go to that place that I need to go..."

# game/scripts/c13/c13.rpy:1590
translate english c13s005_SamanthaHouse_f19e94a6:

    # mc "No hace falta, Jam, puedes comerte mis pastitas si quieres..."
